[{"id":1538,"name":"Round Bamboo Woven Storage Basket from Vietnam","slug":"round-bamboo-woven-storage-basket-from-vietnam","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product\/round-bamboo-woven-storage-basket-from-vietnam\/","sku":"VH24026","short_description":"<p>Premium handcrafted round bamboo storage basket (VH24026) from Vietnam. Custom sizes, OEM\/ODM available. High quality &amp; on-time delivery for wholesale &amp; export.<\/p>","description":"<h4 data-path-to-node=\"4\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Product Overview<\/b><\/h4>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">Elevate your home decor and organization collections with our <b data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"62\">Handcrafted Premium Bamboo Woven Basket (Item Code: VH24026)<\/b>. Expertly woven by master artisans in Vietnam, this round storage basket blends traditional craftsmanship with modern design aesthetics. Featuring a delicate natural bamboo diagonal lattice weave framed by a sleek dark-finished border, it offers both refined elegance and practical versatility for high-end retail, hospitality, and home decor markets.<\/p>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"7\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Key Features &amp; Highlights<\/b><\/h4>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Exquisite Artisan Craftsmanship:<\/b> Each piece is meticulously hand-woven by experienced Vietnamese craftspeople, showcasing superior weaving technique and exceptional attention to detail.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Premium &amp; Sustainable Material:<\/b> Made from 100% natural, eco-friendly, and renewable bamboo, treated to ensure durability, pest resistance, and long-lasting beauty.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Modern &amp; Sophisticated Contrast:<\/b> The natural tone of the bamboo mesh combined with the dark wooden rim creates a timeless piece suitable for contemporary, Scandinavian, rustic, or boho interior styles.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Multi-functional Design:<\/b> Perfect as a decorative tabletop tray, storage basket for fruits, breads, linens, towels, or personal accessories in homes, luxury hotels, spas, and restaurants.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">B2B &amp; Customization Options (OEM \/ ODM)<\/b><\/h4>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">At <b data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"3\">Vietnam Handicraft Co., Ltd<\/b>, we specialize in fulfilling large-scale export orders tailored to meet the specific requirements of international importers, distributors, and brands.<\/p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Custom Dimensions &amp; Designs:<\/b> We can customize sizes, shapes, weaving patterns, and rim colors (natural, stained, painted) according to your exact target specifications and brand requirements.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Custom Packaging &amp; Branding:<\/b> Private labeling, custom hangtags, logo branding, and export-standard packaging are available upon request.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"14\"><b data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Product Specifications<\/b><\/h4>\n<table data-path-to-node=\"15\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Feature<\/strong><\/td>\n<td><strong>Details<\/strong><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Item Code<\/b><\/span><\/td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"15,1,1,0\"><b data-path-t