ed Lacquer Coconut Bowls from Vietnam","slug":"wholesale-hand-painted-lacquer-coconut-bowls-from-vietnam","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product\/wholesale-hand-painted-lacquer-coconut-bowls-from-vietnam\/","sku":"","short_description":"","description":"<h1 data-path-to-node=\"2\">Wholesale Hand-Painted Lacquer Coconut Bowls \u2013 Sustainable Vietnamese Handicrafts<\/h1>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">Are you looking for a unique, eco-friendly, and eye-catching product line to elevate your home decor or giftware collection? We are a leading manufacturer in Vietnam specializing in <b data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"182\">wholesale hand-painted lacquer coconut bowls<\/b>, crafted from natural reclaimed coconut shells and finished with exquisite traditional artistry.<\/p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"5\">Key Features &amp; Specifications<\/h2>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"6\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Base Material:<\/b> 100% Natural Coconut Shell (Reclaimed &amp; Eco-friendly)<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Craftsmanship:<\/b> Hand-sanded, smooth polished, and coated with high-gloss protective lacquer<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Artwork:<\/b> Intricate hand-painted designs (e.g., tropical wildlife, sea turtles, palm trees, floral patterns, and abstract motifs)<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Customization (OEM\/ODM):<\/b> Fully customizable colors, artwork\/patterns, sizes, and private label logos<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Origin:<\/b> Proudly Handcrafted in Vietnam<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"8\">Why Source Lacquer Coconut Bowls from Us?<\/h2>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"9\">1. Eco-Friendly &amp; Sustainable Artisanship<\/h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10\">Every bowl turns a discarded coconut shell into a functional piece of art. By combining renewable natural raw materials with traditional Vietnamese lacquerware techniques, our products appeal directly to modern, environmentally conscious consumers.<\/p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"11\">2. High-Quality Finish &amp; Durability<\/h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">Our coconut bowls undergo a meticulous multi-step production process:<\/p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Selected Raw Shells:<\/b> Thoroughly cleaned, dried, and sanded to ensure a uniform shape and smooth texture.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Premium Lacquer Coating:<\/b> Applied in multiple layers for a vibrant, glossy finish that enhances colors and protects against moisture and wear.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"14\">3. Full Customization (Custom Colors &amp; Artwork)<\/h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">We cater specifically to global importers, wholesalers, and retail brands requiring tailored product lines:<\/p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"16\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Custom Artwork:<\/b> Send us your artwork, theme, or concept, and our master artisans will bring it to life on the lacquer surface.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Color Palettes:<\/b> Choose from a wide range of background shades (gold, turquoise, crimson, pastel tones, etc.) to align with your market trends.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Branding &amp; Packaging:<\/b> Laser-etched logo branding on the base and customized export packaging available upon request.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"17\">4. Competitive Factory-Direct Pricing &amp; On-Time Delivery<\/h3>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"18\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Direct Manufacturer Pricing:<\/b> Operating our own production facilities in Vietnam allows us to offer highly competitive wholesale quotes without middleman markups.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strict Quality Control (QC):<\/b> Every batch is inspected before packing to ensure color accuracy, flawless lacquer finish, and structural integrity.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Timely Shipment:<\/b> We guarantee reliable production schedules and strictly meet agreed delivery deadlines for FCL and LCL container shipments.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"20\">Versatile Applications for Global Retailers<\/h2>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"21\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"21,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"21,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Home &amp; Tabletop Decor:<\/b> Perfect as trinket dishes, key bowls, potpourri displays, or coffee table centerpieces.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"21,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"21,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Eco-Friendly Gifts:<\/b> Ideal for resort boutiques, museum gift shops, souvenir stores, and green lifestyle brands.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"21,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"21,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Hospitality Industry:<\/b> Excellent decorative accents for tropical resorts, eco-lodges, hotels, and spa venues.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"23\">Contact Us for Wholesale Quotes &amp; Samples<\/h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"24\">Enhance your product catalog with high-margin, sustainably made lacquerware from Vietnam. Contact our international export team today to receive catalog updates, order samples, or request a custom quotation!<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" \u20ab"},"price_html":"","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":1537,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH2615-Wholesale-Hand-Painted-Lacquer-Coconut-Bowls.jpg?fit=510%2C600&ssl=1","thumbnail":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH2615-Wholesale-Hand-Painted-Lacquer-Coconut-Bowls.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1","srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH2615-Wholesale-Hand-Painted-Lacquer-Coconut-Bowls.jpg?w=510&ssl=1 510w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH2615-Wholesale-Hand-Painted-Lacquer-Coconut-Bowls.jpg?resize=340%2C400&ssl=1 340w","sizes":"(max-width: 510px) 100vw, 510px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH2615-Wholesale-Hand-Painted-Lacquer-Coconut-Bowls.jpg?resize=280%2C280&ssl=1 280w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH2615-Wholesale-Hand-Painted-Lacquer-Coconut-Bowls.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH2615-Wholesale-Hand-Painted-Lacquer-Coconut-Bowls.jpg?resize=100%2C100&ssl=1 100w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px","name":"VH2615-Wholesale-Hand-Painted-Lacquer-Coconut-Bowls","alt":""}],"categories":[{"id":175,"name":"Bowl","slug":"bowl","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-category\/product-type\/storage-containers\/bowl\/"},{"id":81,"name":"Coconut","slug":"coconut","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-category\/materials\/coconut\/"},{"id