-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Item Code:<\/b> VH24027<\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Category:<\/b> Eco-Friendly Home Decor \/ Storage Baskets &amp; Home Organization<\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Origin:<\/b> Vietnam<\/p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"7\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Overview<\/b><\/h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8\">Upgrade your home organization catalog with our handcrafted <b data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"60\">Black Woven Bamboo Storage Basket Set (Item Code: VH24015)<\/b>. Featuring fine vertical bamboo spokes coated in a sleek black finish, contrasted with natural rattan rims, this set offers a sophisticated modern aesthetic paired with traditional Vietnamese craftsmanship.<\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">Designed to serve as laundry hampers, waste baskets, plant holders, or general storage organizers, these eco-friendly baskets cater to modern minimalist, Nordic, and contemporary interior decor styles for residential and commercial spaces.<\/p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"11\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Key Features &amp; Product Highlights<\/b><\/h3>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sleek Modern Aesthetics:<\/b> The deep black bamboo body combined with warm natural rim accents provides a striking visual contrast that elevates any living room, bedroom, or bathroom space.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Lightweight Yet Durable:<\/b> Constructed from selected natural bamboo sticks, offering lightweight portability without sacrificing structural integrity and strength.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Breathable Open-Spoke Structure:<\/b> The vertical stick design ensures optimal airflow, making it an excellent choice for laundry bins, textile storage, or decorative plant covers.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sustainable Material:<\/b> Handcrafted from 100% fast-renewing natural bamboo, providing an ideal plastic-free alternative for eco-conscious retail markets.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"14\"><b data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Why Partner With Us? (OEM \/ ODM Wholesale Solutions)<\/b><\/h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">As an experienced Vietnamese handicraft manufacturer and exporter, we specialize in delivering tailored production solutions to overseas importers, wholesalers, and retail brands.<\/p>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"16\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Complete Customization (OEM &amp; ODM Services)<\/b><\/h4>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17\">We offer comprehensive customization capabilities to meet your specific brand guidelines and market trends:<\/p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"18\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Custom Dimensions &amp; Designs:<\/b> Available in varying sizes, cylindrical\/tapered profiles, and nested set configurations to minimize shipping volume.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Color Variations:<\/b> Black, natural bamboo, whitewashed, dark brown, or customized color-matched finishes.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Rim &amp; Frame Options:<\/b> Custom binding materials (rattan, seagrass, or synthetic accents) to suit diverse price points.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Branding &amp; Packaging:<\/b> Custom logo tags, barcode labels, and eco-friendly retail packaging optimized for bulk container shipment.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"19\"><b data-path-to-node=\"19\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Rigorous Quality Control<\/b><\/h4>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20\">Every unit undergoes comprehensive moisture testing, anti-mold\/pest treatment, and strict structural inspection before packing to guarantee export-grade quality.<\/p>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"21\"><b data-path-to-node=\"21\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">3. Guaranteed On-Time Delivery &amp; Capacity<\/b><\/h4>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22\">Backed by skilled craft networks and streamlined production lines, we guarantee stable output and strict adherence to agreed shipment schedules for large-volume orders.<\/p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"24\"><b data-path-to-node=\"24\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Product Specifications<\/b><\/h3>\n<table data-path-to-node=\"25\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Feature<\/strong><\/td>\n<td><strong>Details<\/strong><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,1,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"25,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Product Name<\/b><\/span><\/td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,1,1,0\">Black Woven Bamboo Storage Baskets<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,2,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"25,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Material<\/b><\/span><\/td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,2,1,0\">Natural Bamboo &amp; Rattan Rim<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,3,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"25,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Technique<\/b><\/span><\/td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,3,1,0\">Handcrafted Vertical Bamboo Weaving<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,4,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"25,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Color<\/b><\/span><\/td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,4,1,0\">Matte Black with Natural Rim (Customizable)<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=