o-node=\"2\">Handwoven Seagrass Pendant Lampshade on Metal Frame \u2013 Rustic Elegance for Modern Spaces<\/h1>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\"><b data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Item Code:<\/b> VH24028<\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Category:<\/b> Eco-Friendly Home Decor \/ Woven Lighting &amp; Lampshades<\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Origin:<\/b> Vietnam<\/p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"7\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Overview<\/b><\/h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8\">Bring warm, organic texture into interior spaces with our handcrafted <b data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"70\">Seagrass Pendant Lampshade (Item Code: VH24028)<\/b>. Meticulously handwoven over a sturdy inner iron frame, this wide-brimmed shade combines natural aesthetic charm with structural stability.<\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">Designed to cast soft, ambient lighting patterns, this eco-friendly pendant shade is an ideal choice for home decor brands, lighting wholesalers, interior designers, and hospitality projects (cafes, resorts, restaurants, and hotels) looking for modern boho and coastal accents.<\/p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"11\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Key Features &amp; Product Highlights<\/b><\/h3>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sturdy Metal Frame Construction:<\/b> Built upon a durable, anti-rust powder-coated iron frame that maintains the shade&#8217;s signature wide silhouette over long-term use.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Intricate Handwoven Seagrass:<\/b> Crafted from 100% natural seagrass fibers by skilled Vietnamese artisans, offering fine weaving patterns and rich organic texture.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Warm Ambient Illumination:<\/b> The open-weave design allows light to filter through gently, creating inviting warmth and artistic shadow patterns in any room.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sustainable &amp; Eco-Friendly:<\/b> Made from fast-growing natural materials, serving as an attractive green alternative to plastic or synthetic lighting fixtures.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"14\"><b data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Why Choose Us as Your B2B Manufacturing Partner?<\/b><\/h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">As a premier Vietnamese exporter of handcrafted home goods, we cater specifically to the requirements of global importers, distributors, and retail chains.<\/p>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"16\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Comprehensive Customization (OEM \/ ODM Solutions)<\/b><\/h4>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17\">We can tailor every detail to align with your brand&#8217;s vision and target market demands:<\/p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"18\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Custom Dimensions &amp; Shapes:<\/b> Adjustable diameter, height, and frame geometry to fit standard or oversized ceiling installations.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Color Variations:<\/b> Natural seagrass tone, bleached finishes, dark staining, or custom painted accents.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Weaving Patterns &amp; Densities:<\/b> From open lattice styles to dense, intricate weaves.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Hardware Adaptation:<\/b> Custom light fixture fittings (E26 \/ E27 socket holders) and specialized packaging to suit different regional electrical standards and retail needs.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"19\"><b data-path-to-node=\"19\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Rigorous Quality Control<\/b><\/h4>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20\">Our production process includes thorough material selection, proper drying and anti-mold treatment, precise frame welding, and final inspection to ensure every piece meets international export standards.<\/p>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"21\"><b data-path-to-node=\"21\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">3. Reliable Lead Times &amp; Production Capacity<\/b><\/h4>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22\">We manage high-capacity production facilities and a steady network of craft communities, enabling us to guarantee <b data-path-to-node=\"22\" data-index-in-node=\"114\">on-time delivery<\/b> and seamless fulfillment for large wholesale orders.<\/p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"24\"><b data-path-to-node=\"24\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Product Specifications<\/b><\/h3>\n<table data-path-to-node=\"25\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Feature<\/strong><\/td>\n<td><strong>Details<\/strong><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,1,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"25,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Product Name<\/b><\/span><\/td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,1,1,0\">Handwoven Seagrass Lampshade on Iron Frame<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,2,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"25,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Material<\/b><\/span><\/td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,2,1,0\">Natural Seagrass &amp; Iron Frame<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,3,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"25,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Technique<\/b><\/span><\/td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,3,1,0\">Hand-weaving over Metal Structure<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,4,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"25,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Color<\/b><\/span><\/td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,4,1,0\">Natural Beige\/Brown (Customizable upon request)<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,5,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"25,5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Application<\/b><\/span><\/td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,5,1,0\">Living Room, Dining Area, Bedroom, Cafe, Hotel, Resort<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,6,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"25,6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Customization<\/b><\/span><\/td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,6,1,0\">Size, Color, Weave Pattern, Logo, and Retail Packaging<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,7,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"25,7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Compliance<\/b><\/span><\/td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,7,1,0\">Export Quality Standard<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"27\"><b data-path-to-node=\"27\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Grow Your Product Line with Authentic Vietnamese Handicrafts<\/b><\/h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"28\">Partner with us for factory-direct pricing, dependable manufacturing timelines, and custom production tailored to your exact specifications.<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" \u20ab"},"price_html":"","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":1520,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH24028-seagrass-lampshade.jpg?fit=510%2C600&ssl=1","thumbnail":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH24028-seagrass-lampshade.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1","srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH24028-seagrass-lampshade.jpg?w=510&ssl=1 510w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-con