de: VH24029)<\/b>. Combining the rustic warmth of natural bamboo with striking black line accents (black joints\/grooves), this collection offers a perfect blend of traditional Vietnamese artisanship and contemporary design.<\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8\">Made from 100% natural, fast-renewing bamboo, these bowls are ideal for eco-conscious consumers looking for durable, aesthetic, and sustainable tableware or decorative accents for home, hotel, and restaurant spaces.<\/p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Key Features &amp; Product Highlights<\/b><\/h3>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"11\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Authentic Spun Bamboo Craftsmanship:<\/b> Expertly coiled and shaped by skilled artisans in Vietnam, ensuring high strength, smooth finishing, and long-lasting durability.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Unique Aesthetic Design:<\/b> Features a rich natural bamboo tone contrasted with subtle black line details between bamboo layers, accentuating the organic pattern and fine texture of the material.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Eco-Friendly &amp; Sustainable:<\/b> Made from renewable, natural bamboo\u2014a premium alternative to plastic or synthetic materials that appeals directly to green-minded markets.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Versatile Application:<\/b> Perfect as serving bowls, salad\/fruit bowls, key holders, or centerpiece decorative items in dining rooms, living rooms, and hospitality environments.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"13\"><b data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Why Partner With Us? (OEM \/ ODM Wholesale Solutions)<\/b><\/h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">We are a trusted Vietnamese manufacturer dedicated to supplying high-quality handicraft products to international importers, distributors, and retail chains.<\/p>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"15\"><b data-path-to-node=\"15\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Full Customization (OEM &amp; ODM Available)<\/b><\/h4>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16\">We understand that every market has unique trends and customer requirements. We provide flexible OEM\/ODM manufacturing services, including:<\/p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"17\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Custom Sizes &amp; Shapes:<\/b> Available in various diameters, depths, and set configurations.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Custom Colors &amp; Finishes:<\/b> Natural finish, matte lacquer, glossy coating, custom painted exteriors, or specialized inner linings.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Branding &amp; Packaging:<\/b> Custom logo placement (laser engraving, brand stamps) and retail-ready eco-friendly packaging tailored to your brand standards.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"18\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Strict Quality Assurance<\/b><\/h4>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19\">From material selection and anti-mold\/pest treatment to final lacquering and inspection, our strict Quality Control (QC) process guarantees consistent export-standard craftsmanship across all units.<\/p>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"20\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">3. Reliable Production Capacity &amp; On-Time Delivery<\/b><\/h4>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"21\">Supported by an established production network and experienced craftspeople, we handle high-volume wholesale orders efficiently while adhering strictly to agreed shipping schedules and lead times.<\/p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"23\"><b data-path-to-node=\"23\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Specifications at a Glance<\/b><\/h3>\n<table data-path-to-node=\"24\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Feature<\/strong><\/td>\n<td><strong>Details<\/strong><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"24,1,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"24,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Product Name<\/b><\/span><\/td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"24,1,1,0\">Spun Bamboo Bowls (Natural Finish with Black Accents)<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"24,2,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"24,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Material<\/b><\/span><\/td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"24,2,1,0\">100% Natural Bamboo<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"24,3,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"24,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Technique<\/b><\/span><\/td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"24,3,1,0\">Hand-spun \/ Coiled Bamboo<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"24,4,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"24,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Color<\/b><\/span><\/td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"24,4,1,0\">Natural Bamboo with Black Grooves (Customizable)<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"24,5,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"24,5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Usage<\/b><\/span><\/td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"24,5,1,0\">Home Decor, Kitchenware, Tableware, Fruit\/Salad Bowl, Giftware<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"24,6,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"24,6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Customization<\/b><\/span><\/td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"24,6,1,0\">Size, Color, Logo, and Packaging upon request<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"24,7,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"24,7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Supply Ability<\/b><\/span><\/td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"24,7,1,0\">Bulk production with strict quality standard compliance<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"26\"><b data-path-to-node=\"26\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Ready to Expand Your Eco-Friendly Product Line?<\/b><\/h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"27\">Contact our export team today for product catalogs, custom sampling, and competitive FOB wholesale pricing.<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" \u20ab"},"price_html":"","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":1515,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH24029-spun-bamboo-bowl-from-Vietnam.jpg?fit=510%2C600&ssl=1","thumbnail":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH24029-spun-bamboo-bowl-from-Vietnam.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1","srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH24029-spun-bamboo-bowl-from-Vietnam.jpg?w=510&ssl=1 510w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH24029-spun-bamboo-bowl-from-Vietnam.jpg?resize=340%2C400&ssl=1 340w","sizes":"(max-width: 510px) 100vw, 510px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH24029-spun-bamboo-bowl-from-Vietnam.jpg?resize=280%2C280&ssl=1 280w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH24029-spun-bamboo-bowl-from-Vietnam.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH24029-spun-bamboo-bowl-from-Vietnam.jpg?resize=100%2C100&ssl=1 100w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px","name":"VH24029-spun-bamboo-bowl-from-Vietnam","alt":""}],"categories":[{"id":71,"name":"Bamboo","slug":"bamboo","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-category\/materials\/bamboo\/"},{"id":34,"name":"Bamboo Bowls","slug":"bamboo-bowls","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-category\/product