turer","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-tag\/spun-bamboo-bowls-manufacturer\/"},{"id":1355,"name":"Spun Bamboo Bowls suppliers","slug":"spun-bamboo-bowls-suppliers","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-tag\/spun-bamboo-bowls-suppliers\/"},{"id":1354,"name":"Spun Bamboo Bowls wholesales","slug":"spun-bamboo-bowls-wholesales","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-tag\/spun-bamboo-bowls-wholesales\/"}],"brands":[],"attributes":[],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":false,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"N\/A","formatted_dimensions":"N\/A","add_to_cart":{"text":"Read more","description":"Read more about &ldquo;Spun Bamboo Bowls set made in Vietnam&rdquo;","url":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product\/spun-bamboo-bowls-set-made-in-vietnam\/","single_text":"Add to cart","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/1511","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=1511&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":1503,"name":"Recycled Tyre Rubber Log Baskets made in Vietnam","slug":"recycled-tyre-rubber-log-baskets-made-in-vietnam","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product\/recycled-tyre-rubber-log-baskets-made-in-vietnam\/","sku":"VH2613","short_description":"","description":"<h3 data-path-to-node=\"3\"><b data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Eco-Friendly Recycled Tyre Rubber Log Baskets<\/b><\/h3>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"4\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Introduction<\/b><\/h4>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">As European consumers increasingly prioritize sustainability and eco-friendly home living, businesses in the hearth and heating industry are looking for innovative ways to add value to their products. If you are a wholesaler, distributor, or retailer of <b data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"254\">wood-burning stoves and fireplaces in Europe<\/b>, enhancing your customer experience with a practical, eco-conscious gift is a proven way to boost customer loyalty and brand prestige.<\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">Introducing our <b data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"16\">Handcrafted Recycled Rubber Tyre Basket<\/b>\u00a0\u2014 an exceptionally durable, stylish, and sustainable log basket designed to complement any modern or rustic fireplace setting.<\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1509\" src=\"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH2613-Recycled-rubber-log-baskets-factory.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1600\" height=\"2133\" \/><\/p>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Why European Fireplace Retailers Should Choose Recycled Rubber Log Baskets<\/b><\/h4>\n<h5 data-path-to-node=\"9\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Premium Promotional Gift for Fireplace &amp; Wood Stove Buyers<\/b><\/h5>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10\">Stand out from competitors by offering a high-value accessory with every wood stove purchase. This recycled rubber basket serves as an ideal <b data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"141\">&#8220;Free Gift with Purchase&#8221;<\/b> or a premium add-on accessory. It enhances your promotional campaigns while offering end-users an indispensable tool for carrying and storing firewood right next to their hearth.<\/p>\n<h5 data-path-to-node=\"11\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Superior Durability &amp; Practical Design for Firewood Storage<\/b><\/h5>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">Unlike traditional wicker or canvas baskets that can fray, tear, or drop messy wood chips and sawdust onto living room floors:<\/p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Heavy-Duty Strength:<\/b> Made from recycled vehicle tires, these baskets are virtually indestructible, weather-resistant, and tear-proof.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Easy Clean &amp; No Spills:<\/b> The solid rubber construction ensures small debris, wood bark, and dust stay inside the basket, keeping floors spotless.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Ergonomic Handles:<\/b> Reinforced with sturdy metal rivets and comfortable handles, making transporting heavy wooden logs effortless.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h5 data-path-to-node=\"14\"><b data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">3. Sustainable &amp; Eco-Friendly: Turning Used Tires into Value<\/b><\/h5>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">European customers demand green solutions. Every year, millions of scrap tires accumulate in landfills globally. Our manufacturing process upcycles spent rubber tires into beautiful, functional household items.<\/p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"16\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\">Reduces waste and carbon footprint.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\">Promotes circular economy practices.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\">Provides a compelling eco-story that resonates strongly with European consumers.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h5 data-path-to-node=\"17\"><b data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">4. Empathetic Social Impact: Empowering Rural Artisans<\/b><\/h5>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18\">Our rubber baskets are meticulously handcrafted by skilled artisans in rural communities during their off-farm seasons. By sourcing these products wholesale from us, you directly contribute to:<\/p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"19\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\">Generating stable supplementary income for local agricultural workers between harvesting seasons.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\">Preserving traditional handcrafting skills.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0\">Supporting ethical, socially responsible supply chain practices.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><\/p>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"21\"><b data-path-to-node=\"21\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Wholesale &amp; B2B Purchasing Options<\/b><\/h4>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22\">We specialize in direct B2B manufacturing and wholesale exporting to European markets. We offer flexible partnership terms tailored for distributors, stove manufacturers, and hearth accessory retailers:<\/p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"23\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"23,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Customization &amp; Branding:<\/b> Custom dimensions, stitching styles, and branding options (tags\/logos) available upon request.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"23,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Bulk Packaging &amp; Efficient Logistics:<\/b> Designed for optimal stacking to maximize container space and reduce shipping costs to Europe.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"23,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Consistent Quality Control:<\/b> Each basket undergoes strict quality inspection to ensure premium craftsmanship and durability.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"25\"><b data-path-to-node=\"25\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Partner With Us Today<\/b><\/h4>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"26\">Elevate your fireplace product line with a functional, eco-friendly product that tells a meaningful story.<\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"27\">Contact our export team today for <b data-path-to-node=\"27\" data-index-in-node=\"34\">wholesale quotes, product catalogs, and sample orders<\/b><\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" \u20ab"},"price_html":"","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":1507,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH2613-Recycled-rubber-log-baskets.jpg?fit=510%2C600&ssl=1","thumbnail":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH2613-Recycled-rubber-log-baskets.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1","srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH2613-Recycled-rubber-log-baskets.jpg?w=510&ssl=1 510w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH2613-Recycled-rubber-log-baskets.jpg?resize=340%2C400&ssl=1 340w","sizes":"(max-width: 510px) 100vw, 510px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH2613-Recycled-rubber-log-baskets.jpg?resize=280%2C280&ssl=1 280w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH2613-Recycled-rubber-log-baskets.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH2613-Recycled-rubber-log-baskets.jpg?resize=100%2C100&ssl=1 100w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px","name":"VH2613-Recycled-rubber-log-baskets","alt":""}],"categories":[{"id":173,"name":"Basket","slug":"basket","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-category\/product-type\/storage-containers\/basket\/"},{"id":61,"name":"Garden &amp; Outdoor","slug":"garden-outdoor","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-category\/home-living\/garden-outdoor\/"},{"id":202,"name":"Home Living","slug":"home-living","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-category\/home-living\/"},{"id":207,"name":"Hotel &amp; Restaurant","slug":"hotel-restaurant","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-category\/home-living\/hotel-restaurant\/"},{"id":70,"name":"Materials","slug":"materials","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-category\/materials\/"},{"id":167,"name":"Product Type","slug":"product-type","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-category\/product-type\/"},{"id":158,"name":"Recycled Rubber","slug":"recycled-rubber","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-category\/materials\/recycled-rubber\/"},{"id":168,"name":"Storage &amp; Containers","slug":"storage-containers","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-category\/product-type\/storage-containers\/"}],"tags":[{"id":1347,"name":"Recycled Rubber Log Baskets","slug":"recycled-rubber-log-baskets","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-tag\/recycled-rubber-log-baskets\/"},{"id":1349,"name":"Recycled Rubber Log Baskets manufacturer","slug":"recycled-rubber-log-baskets-manufacturer","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-tag\/recycled-rubber-log-baskets-manufacturer\/"},{"id":1348,"name":"Recycled Rubber Log Baskets suppliers","slug":"recycled-rubber-log-baskets-suppliers","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-tag\/recycled-rubber-log-baskets-suppliers\/"},{"id":1350,"name":"Recycled Rubber Log Baskets wholesale","slug":"recycled-rubber-log-baskets-wholesale","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-tag\/recycled-rubber-log-baskets-wholesale\/"}],"brands":[],"attributes":[],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":false,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"N\/A","formatted_dimensions":"N\/A","add_to_cart":{"text":"Read more","description":"Read more about &ldquo;Recycled Tyre Rubber Log Baskets made in Vietnam&rdquo;","url":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product\/recycled-tyre-rubber-log-baskets-made-in-vietnam\/","single_text":"Add to cart","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/1503","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=1503&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":1495,"name":"Handcrafted Sea Turtle Rattan Tray with Mother-of-Pearl Base","slug":"handcrafted-sea-turtle-rattan-tray-with-mother-of-pearl-base","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product\/handcrafted-sea-turtle-rattan-tray-with-mother-of-pearl-base\/","sku":"VH2612","short_description":"","description":"<h3 data-path-to-node=\"2\"><b data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Handcrafted Sea Turtle Rattan Tray with Mother-of-Pearl Base: Coastal Artistry &amp; Custom Manufacturing<\/b><\/h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">As global demand for eco-friendly home decor and artistic tabletop accessories continues to rise, unique handcrafted items with coastal aesthetics are top sellers across retail channels. We are proud to present our <b data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"215\">Handcrafted Rattan Serving Tray featuring a Hand-Painted Sea Turtle on a Shell Base<\/b>\u2014a perfect combination of natural materials, fine hand-craftsmanship, and artistic functionality.<\/p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"5\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Key Highlights &amp; Product Features<\/b><\/h3>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Premium Natural Materials &amp; Artisan Craftsmanship<\/b><\/h4>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sturdy Hand-Woven Rattan Rim:<\/b> Crafted from natural, durable rattan that is carefully woven to create a strong, structural border with intricate stitching details.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Mother-of-Pearl (MOP) Base:<\/b> The interior surface features shimmering natural shell inlay, providing an elegant, iridescent backdrop for the vibrant artwork.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Hand-Painted Coastal Artwork:<\/b> Showcases a detailed sea turtle swimming amidst colorful coral reefs, making each piece a unique work of art.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Multi-Functional Home Decor Accent<\/b><\/h4>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"9\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Decorative Display:<\/b> Perfect centerpiece for coffee tables, sideboards, ottomans, or wall displays in coastal and tropical-themed interiors.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Serving Tray:<\/b> Suitable for serving drinks, snacks, or organizing vanity items, candles, and accessories.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"11\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Our Manufacturing Strengths: Customization, Quality &amp; Speed<\/b><\/h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">We specialize in high-quality OEM\/ODM manufacturing for importers, wholesalers, boutique brands, and e-commerce sellers worldwide. When you partner with us, you gain access to flexible custom solutions tailored to your business needs:<\/p>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"13\"><b data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">\ud83c\udfa8 100% Custom Design &amp; Bespoke Artwork<\/b><\/h4>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"14\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Custom Patterns &amp; Artwork:<\/b> Have your own designs, patterns, or artwork? We can hand-paint or print custom graphics onto the shell base according to your specifications.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Custom Logos &amp; Branding:<\/b> We offer logo customization (laser engraving on the rattan frame, printed bottom logos, custom woven tags, or private label packaging).<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"14,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Personalized Text &amp; Messaging:<\/b> Add customized text, brand names, or specific mottos directly onto the product or packaging for private-label collections.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"15\"><b data-path-to-node=\"15\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">\u23f1\ufe0f Fast Production &amp; On-Time Delivery<\/b><\/h4>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16\">We understand that supply chain reliability is critical to your business.<\/p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"17\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Optimized Production Line:<\/b> Backed by skilled artisans and streamlined craft village logistics, we handle large volume orders efficiently.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strict Schedule Adherence:<\/b> We guarantee reliable production timelines and on-time shipment fulfillment for both LCL and FCL orders.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"18\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Rigorous Quality Control (QC)<\/b><\/h4>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"19\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Strict Standard Inspections:<\/b> Every single unit undergoes thorough quality checks for weave tightness, shell inlay durability, moisture control, and flawless finishing before packing.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Export-Ready Packaging:<\/b> Standardized mail-order and retail packaging designed to withstand international transit and drop tests.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"21\"><b data-path-to-node=\"21\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sustainable Impact: Community Empowerment &amp; Cultural Preservation<\/b><\/h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22\">Sourcing with us creates real social impact in local Vietnamese craft villages:<\/p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"23\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"23,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Job Creation:<\/b> Provides stable employment and fair wages for local rattan harvesters, shell inlay artisans, and painters.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"23,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Cultural Preservation:<\/b> Keeps Vietnam\u2019s rich heritage of natural fiber weaving and lacquercraft thriving for future generations.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"25\"><b data-path-to-node=\"25\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Partner with a Trusted OEM\/ODM Manufacturer<\/b><\/h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"26\">Elevate your product catalog with high-margin, customizable handcrafted goods directly from Vietnam.<\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"27\">\ud83d\udce9 <b data-path-to-node=\"27\" data-index-in-node=\"3\">Contact Us Today<\/b> to request sample orders, product catalogs, or competitive wholesale FOB quotations!<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" \u20ab"},"price_html":"","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":1499,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH2612-Handcrafted-Sea-Turtle-Rattan-Tray-with-Mother-of-Pearl-Base.jpg?fi