stock_availability":{"text":"","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"N\/A","formatted_dimensions":"N\/A","add_to_cart":{"text":"Read more","description":"Read more about &ldquo;Handcrafted Sea Turtle Rattan Tray with Mother-of-Pearl Base&rdquo;","url":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product\/handcrafted-sea-turtle-rattan-tray-with-mother-of-pearl-base\/","single_text":"Add to cart","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/1495","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=1495&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":1490,"name":"Handcrafted Round Rattan Tray with Mother-of-Pearl Inlay made in Vietnam","slug":"handcrafted-round-rattan-tray-with-mother-of-pearl-inlay-made-in-vietnam","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product\/handcrafted-round-rattan-tray-with-mother-of-pearl-inlay-made-in-vietnam\/","sku":"24030","short_description":"","description":"<h3 data-path-to-node=\"2\"><b data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Handcrafted Round Rattan Tray with Mother-of-Pearl Inlay: Timeless Elegance &amp; Artisanal Luxury<\/b><\/h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">As demand grows for high-end eco-friendly home decor, products combining natural fibers with organic luxury finishes continue to drive global sales. We are proud to introduce our <b data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"179\">Handcrafted Round Rattan Tray with Mother-of-Pearl (MOP) Inlay<\/b>, a exquisite piece designed to bring coastal elegance and artisan craft into modern living spaces.<\/p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"5\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Key Selling Points &amp; Product Features<\/b><\/h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Premium Natural &amp; Eco-Friendly Materials<\/b> Crafted from durable, fast-growing natural rattan and ethically sourced mother-of-pearl (MOP) shell tiles. This piece offers a luxury alternative to synthetic, plastic, or plain wooden trays.<\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Exquisite Artisan Craftsmanship<\/b> Every single tray is painstakingly handcrafted by skilled Vietnamese artisans. Key design highlights include:<\/p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Inlaid Shell Base:<\/b> The interior surface features hand-placed mother-of-pearl mosaic tiles forming a shimmering ivory backdrop, detailed with delicate green four-leaf clover motifs.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Hand-Woven Rattan Frame:<\/b> Sturdy, tightly coiled rattan rim that provides structural durability and organic warmth.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Built-In Cutout Handles:<\/b> Ergonomically designed woven handles for effortless carrying and serving.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">3. Versatile Functionality &amp; Styling<\/b><\/p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Decorative Tray:<\/b> Accent piece on ottomans, coffee tables, dressers, or dining sideboards.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Serving Tray:<\/b> Elegant vessel for drinks, tea, breakfast, or appetizers during gatherings.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Vanity &amp; Organizer:<\/b> Keeps perfumes, jewelry, cosmetics, or candles organized in style.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"12\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sustainable Impact: Empowering Communities &amp; Preserving Heritage<\/b><\/h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13\">Your sourcing partnership creates direct social impact in Vietnamese craft communities:<\/p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"14\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Job Creation for Rural Artisans:<\/b> Rattan harvesting, processing, and intricate shell-inlay work provide stable livelihoods and fair wages for local farmers and rural craftspeople.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Preserving Traditional Heritage:<\/b> Vietnam has centuries of expertise in lacquerware and mother-of-pearl inlay techniques. Exporting these handcrafted trays sustains local craft villages and keeps traditional arts thriving.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"16\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">OEM \/ ODM &amp; Custom Manufacturing Solutions<\/b><\/h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17\">We offer full customization flexibility to meet your target market requirements:<\/p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"18\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Custom Inlay Patterns &amp; Colors:<\/b> Modify shell mosaic motifs (floral, geometric, herringbone) and shell colors (natural white, pearl, green, blue, black MOP).<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Dimensions &amp; Shapes:<\/b> Custom diameters, depths, or alternative shapes (rectangular, oval, square).<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Private Labeling &amp; Packaging:<\/b> Laser-engraved logos, custom barcode tags, drop-test protective e-commerce packaging, and retail-ready gift boxes.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"20\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Partner with Us Today<\/b><\/h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"21\">Elevate your home decor catalog with handcrafted luxury items from Vietnam.<\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22\">\ud83d\udce9 <b data-path-to-node=\"22\" data-index-in-node=\"3\">Contact Us Today<\/b> to request product catalogs, sample units, or competitive FOB wholesale quotations!<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" \u20ab"},"price_html":"","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":1494,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH24030-Round-tray-from-Rattan-MOP.jpg?fit=510%2C600&ssl=1","thumbnail":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH24030-Round-tray-from-Rattan-MOP.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1","srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH24030-Round-tray-from-Rattan-MOP.jpg?w=510&ssl=1 510w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH24030-Round-tray-from-Rattan-MOP.jpg?resize=340%2C400&ssl=1 340w","sizes":"(max-width: 510px) 100vw, 510px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH24030-Round-tray-from-Rattan-MOP.jpg?resize=280%2C280&ssl=1 280w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH24030-Round-tray-from-Rattan-MOP.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH24030-Round-tray-from-Rattan-MOP.jpg?resize=100%2C100&ssl=1 100w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 300px) 100vw