"","permalink":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product\/handcrafted-bamboo-rattan-pendant-light-made-in-vietnam\/","sku":"VH24031","short_description":"","description":"<h3 data-path-to-node=\"2\"><b data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Handcrafted Bamboo &amp; Rattan Pendant Light: Organic Warmth for Contemporary Spaces<\/b><\/h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">As interior design trends shift towards natural materials, biophilic aesthetics, and sustainable home decor, woven lighting fixtures have become high-demand statement pieces across global markets. We are proud to introduce our <b data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"227\">Handcrafted Bamboo &amp; Rattan Pendant Light<\/b>, a stunning light fixture designed to bring organic warmth, artistic elegance, and rustic sophistication to any interior setting.<\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1489\" src=\"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH24031-pendant-light-made-of-bamboo-rattan-from-vietnam.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1080\" \/><\/p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"5\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Key Highlights &amp; Product Features<\/b><\/h3>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. 100% Eco-Friendly &amp; Sustainable Materials<\/b><\/h4>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">Crafted from natural, rapidly renewable bamboo and rattan, this pendant light offers a clean, eco-conscious alternative to industrial plastic and metal fixtures. Each piece is treated naturally without harsh chemicals, retaining its light organic hue while offering exceptional durability and lightweight structure.<\/p>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Artisanal Weaving &amp; Sculptural Design<\/b><\/h4>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">Every lamp shade is meticulously hand-woven by master Vietnamese artisans using traditional basketry techniques. Key design details include:<\/p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sculptural Wavy Brim Silhouette:<\/b> The wide, fluted shade features dynamic, organic curves that cast captivating light-and-shadow patterns across room surfaces when illuminated.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Intricate Weave Pattern:<\/b> The tightly woven neck transitions into a wider open weave, creating a harmonious balance between structure and soft ambient light distribution.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Warm Ambient Atmosphere:<\/b> Perfect for housing warm LED filament bulbs to create a cozy, inviting ambiance in dining areas, living rooms, and hospitality venues.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"11\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">3. Versatile Commercial &amp; Residential Application<\/b><\/h4>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">This versatile pendant light fits seamlessly into modern Scandinavian, Bohemian, Japandi, coastal, and eco-luxury design projects. It is an ideal addition for home decor importers, lighting wholesalers, resort developers, cafe owners, and hospitality interior design firms.<\/p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"14\"><b data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sustainable Impact: Empowering Communities &amp; Preserving Heritage<\/b><\/h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">By sourcing our handcrafted rattan and bamboo lighting fixtures, your brand actively supports sustainable development and community growth:<\/p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"16\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Job Creation for Rural Farmers &amp; Artisans:<\/b> Bamboo and rattan harvesting and weaving provide consistent employment and fair wages for local farmers and skilled craftspeople in traditional Vietnamese craft villages.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Preserving Traditional Craftsmanship:<\/b> Vietnam has a centuries-old heritage of natural fiber weaving. Bringing these artisanal lamps to global markets helps preserve cultural heritage and keep traditional craft communities thriving for future generations.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"18\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">OEM \/ ODM &amp; Custom Manufacturing Solutions<\/b><\/h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19\">We offer comprehensive custom manufacturing capabilities to help you meet your specific market demands:<\/p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"20\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Custom Colors &amp; Stains:<\/b> Available in natural light beige, vintage brown, smoked black, or custom lacquer finishes to fit your brand\u2019s palette.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Custom Dimensions:<\/b> We can scale shade diameters and heights according to project or catalog specifications.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Electrical Components &amp; Certification Compliance:<\/b> Shades can be supplied individually or with pre-wired cord sets (E26\/E27 sockets, ceiling roses, and cord lengths) compliant with international safety standards (CE, UL, RoHS, SAA).<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Export &amp; E-Commerce Packaging:<\/b> Robust mail-order packaging, nested stacking options for optimized container loading, barcode labeling, and custom branding boxes.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"22\"><b data-path-to-node=\"22\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Partner with Us Today<\/b><\/h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23\">Illuminate your portfolio with authentic, eco-friendly lighting solutions from Vietnam.<\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"24\">\ud83d\udce9 <b data-path-to-node=\"24\" data-index-in-node=\"3\">Contact Us Today<\/b> to request product catalogs, sample units, or competitive FOB wholesale quotations!<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" \u20ab"},"price_html":"","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":1487,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH24031-pendant-light-made-of-bamboo-rattan.jpg?fit=510%2C600&ssl=1","thumbnail":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH24031-pendant-light-made-of-bamboo-rattan.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1","srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH24031-pendant-light-made-of-bamboo-rattan.jpg?w=510&ssl=1 510w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH24031-pendant-light-made-of-bamboo-rattan.jpg?resize=340%2C400&ssl=1 340w","sizes":"(max-width: 510px) 100vw, 510px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH24031-pendant-light-made-of-bamboo-rattan.jpg?resize=280%2C280&ssl=1 280w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH24031-pendant-light-made-of-bamboo-rattan.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH24031-pendant-light-made-of-bamboo-rattan.jpg?resize=100%2C100&ssl=1 100w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px","name":"VH24031-pendant-light-made-of-bamboo-rattan","alt":""},{"id":1489,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH24031-pendant-light-made-of-bamboo-r