"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"N\/A","formatted_dimensions":"N\/A","add_to_cart":{"text":"Read more","description":"Read more about &ldquo;Handcrafted Water Hyacinth Handbag with Seashell Embellishments from Vietnam&rdquo;","url":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product\/handcrafted-water-hyacinth-handbag-with-seashell-embellishments-from-vietnam\/","single_text":"Add to cart","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/1478","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=1478&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":1473,"name":"Handcrafted Spun Bamboo Fruit Bowl from Vietnam","slug":"handcrafted-spun-bamboo-fruit-bowl-from-vietnam","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product\/handcrafted-spun-bamboo-fruit-bowl-from-vietnam\/","sku":"VH24033","short_description":"","description":"<h3 data-path-to-node=\"2\"><b data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Handcrafted Spun Bamboo Fruit Bowl: Sustainable Elegance for Modern Living<\/b><\/h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">As consumers worldwide seek eco-conscious, stylish, and functional home decor, sustainable kitchenware continues to top demand across global markets. We are proud to present our <b data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"178\">Handcrafted Spun Bamboo Fruit Bowl<\/b>, a versatile center-piece designed to combine natural beauty, minimalism, and artisanal craftsmanship.<\/p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"5\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Key Product Features &amp; Selling Points<\/b><\/h3>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. 100% Eco-Friendly, Organic &amp; Natural<\/b><\/h4>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">Crafted from 100% natural, rapidly renewable bamboo, this fruit bowl is a safe, sustainable alternative to plastic, metal, or synthetic home decor. Free from toxic chemicals and heavy metals, it offers health-conscious consumers peace of mind while bringing an earthy, organic aesthetic to any living space.<\/p>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Traditional Spun Bamboo Craftsmanship<\/b><\/h4>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">Each bowl is meticulously hand-coiled and shaped by skilled Vietnamese artisans using time-tested <b data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"98\">spun bamboo techniques<\/b>. The interior highlights the natural, warm bamboo grain, while the exterior features a smooth, durable lacquered coating (shown in a elegant soft cream\/beige tone), creating a striking dual-tone contrast.<\/p>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">3. Multi-Functional &amp; Stylish Design<\/b><\/h4>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">With its shallow, wide-opening silhouette, this bowl is perfectly proportioned for various uses:<\/p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Fruit Bowl &amp; Centerpiece:<\/b> Keeps fresh fruits well-ventilated while serving as a stunning focal point on dining tables, kitchen islands, or coffee tables.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Decorative Storage Tray:<\/b> Ideal for holding keys, mail, potpourri, or everyday accessories in entryways and living rooms.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Serving Bowl:<\/b> Suitable for dry foods, snacks, bread, or decorative decorative displays.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"14\"><b data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sustainable Impact: Empowering Communities &amp; Preserving Heritage<\/b><\/h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">Partnering with us allows your brand to support sustainable economic growth and cultural preservation:<\/p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"16\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Job Creation for Rural Farmers &amp; Artisans:<\/b> Every order directly provides stable livelihoods and fair wages to bamboo farmers and skilled village artisans in rural Vietnam.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Preserving Traditional Craft Villages:<\/b> Vietnam has a rich history of hand-spinning bamboo and lacquering. By exporting these handcrafted goods, we help sustain traditional craft villages and pass these unique skills to future generations.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"18\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">OEM \/ ODM &amp; Custom Manufacturing Solutions<\/b><\/h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19\">To help you serve your target market effectively, we offer fully customizable OEM\/ODM services:<\/p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"20\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Custom Colors &amp; Finishes:<\/b> Available in a wide spectrum of exterior colors (neutral tones, pastels, matte, or high-gloss lacquers) to align with your seasonal collections or brand identity.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Custom Dimensions:<\/b> Sizes can be adjusted according to your technical specifications.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Private Labeling &amp; Packaging:<\/b> We provide custom logo laser-engraving, barcode labelling, eco-friendly retail packaging, and drop-test packaging suitable for e-commerce fulfillment (Amazon, Etsy, mail order).<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"22\"><b data-path-to-node=\"22\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Partner with Us<\/b><\/h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23\">We invite importers, wholesalers, retail buyers, and home decor brand owners to join us in promoting sustainable, beautifully crafted bamboo products.<\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"24\">\ud83d\udce9 <b data-path-to-node=\"24\" data-index-in-node=\"3\">Contact Us Today<\/b> to request product catalogs, sample units, or competitive FOB wholesale quotations!<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" \u20ab"},"price_html":"","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":1477,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH24033-Fruit-bowl-made-of-bamboo-in-Vietnam.jpg?fit=510%2C600&ssl=1","thumbnail":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH24033-Fruit-bowl-made-of-bamboo-in-Vietnam.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1","srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH24033-Fruit-bowl-made-of-bamboo-in-Vietnam.jpg?w=510&ssl=1 510w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH24033-Fruit-bowl-made-of-bamboo-in-Vietnam.jpg?resize=340%2C400&ssl=1 340w","sizes":"(max-width: 510px) 100vw, 510px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH24033-Fruit-bowl-made-of-bamboo-in-Vietnam.jpg?resize=280%2C280&ssl=1 280w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH24033-Fruit-bowl-made-of-bamboo-in-Vietnam.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/