"name":"Spun bamboo bowl factory","slug":"spun-bamboo-bowl-factory","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-tag\/spun-bamboo-bowl-factory\/"},{"id":1149,"name":"Spun bamboo bowl made in Vietnam","slug":"spun-bamboo-bowl-made-in-vietnam","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-tag\/spun-bamboo-bowl-made-in-vietnam\/"},{"id":1327,"name":"Spun Bamboo bowl manufacturer","slug":"spun-bamboo-bowl-manufacturer","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-tag\/spun-bamboo-bowl-manufacturer\/"},{"id":1328,"name":"Spun Bamboo bowl wholesales","slug":"spun-bamboo-bowl-wholesales","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-tag\/spun-bamboo-bowl-wholesales\/"}],"brands":[],"attributes":[],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":false,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"N\/A","formatted_dimensions":"N\/A","add_to_cart":{"text":"Read more","description":"Read more about &ldquo;Handcrafted Spun Bamboo Fruit Bowl from Vietnam&rdquo;","url":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product\/handcrafted-spun-bamboo-fruit-bowl-from-vietnam\/","single_text":"Add to cart","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/1473","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=1473&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":1466,"name":"Handmade Spun Bamboo Salad Bowl Sets manufacturer in Vietnam","slug":"handmade-spun-bamboo-salad-bowl-sets-manufacturer-in-vietnam","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product\/handmade-spun-bamboo-salad-bowl-sets-manufacturer-in-vietnam\/","sku":"VH24034","short_description":"","description":"<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">In an era where consumers increasingly value sustainability, authenticity, and elegance, offering eco-conscious kitchenware is no longer just a trend\u2014it\u2019s a necessity for modern retailers and distributors. We are proud to introduce our <b data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"236\">Handmade Spun Bamboo Salad Bowl Set (Set of 7)<\/b>, a perfect blend of natural aesthetics, functional design, and meaningful craftsmanship.<\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1472\" src=\"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH24034-spun-bamboo-bowl-manufacturer-in-Vietnam.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1080\" \/><\/p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"5\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Key Highlights of Our Product<\/b><\/h3>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. 100% Eco-Friendly, Natural &amp; Organic<\/b><\/h4>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">Crafted from fast-growing, highly renewable natural bamboo, our salad bowl sets offer an organic alternative to plastic and synthetic tableware. Each piece undergoes carefully managed processing without harmful chemicals, ensuring safety for daily food serving and peace of mind for health-conscious consumers.<\/p>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Authentic Artisanal Craftsmanship<\/b><\/h4>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">Unlike mass-produced plastic or melamine products, every single bowl and server in this 7-piece set is individually handcrafted by skilled Vietnamese artisans using traditional <b data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"177\">spun bamboo techniques<\/b>. The unique coiled texture and smooth lacquered finish showcase the natural grain of bamboo, making each set a true piece of art.<\/p>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">3. Functional 7-Piece Set Design<\/b><\/h4>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">Designed for practical, everyday use as well as elegant hosting, the set includes:<\/p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1 Large Serving Bowl:<\/b> Ideal for tossing and serving fresh salads, fruits, or bread.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">4 Individual Salad Bowls:<\/b> Perfectly sized for personal servings.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2 Matching Salad Servers (Spoon &amp; Fork):<\/b> Ergonomically designed with matching bamboo finishes to complete the ensemble.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"14\"><b data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Creating Sustainable Impact: Empowering Communities &amp; Preserving Heritage<\/b><\/h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">When you choose to partner with us, your order extends far beyond a commercial transaction:<\/p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"16\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Job Creation for Rural Farmers &amp; Artisans:<\/b> Exporting our spun bamboo products creates stable employment and sustainable income for local farmers who cultivate bamboo, as well as rural artisans who hand-craft each piece.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Preserving Traditional Craftsmanship:<\/b> Vietnam has a centuries-old tradition of bamboo weaving and lacquering. By bringing these products to international markets, we help preserve cultural heritage and keep traditional craft villages thriving for future generations.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"18\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">OEM \/ ODM &amp; Custom Manufacturing Solutions<\/b><\/h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19\">We understand that every market and brand has unique requirements. We offer fully customizable manufacturing services tailored to your business needs:<\/p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"20\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Custom Colors &amp; Finishes:<\/b> Choose from natural, matte, glossy, or custom lacquered outer colors (e.g., olive green, pastel tones, classic black, or white) to match your brand palette.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Size &amp; Shape Modifications:<\/b> We can adapt dimensions or set compositions upon request.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Custom Logo &amp; Packaging:<\/b> Private labeling, laser-engraved logos, eco-friendly gift boxes, barcode stickers, and export-ready packaging designed specifically for retail display or e-commerce shipping (Amazon, Etsy, retail stores).<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"22\"><b data-path-to-node=\"22\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Partner with Us Today<\/b><\/h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23\">We welcome importers, wholesalers, retail chains, and brand owners around the globe to collaborate with us. Let&#8217;s work together to bring eco-friendly, meaningful, and beautifully crafted products to households worldwide.<\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"24\">\ud83d\udce9 <b data-path-to-node=\"24\" data-index-in-node=\"3\">Contact Us Today<\/b> to request product catalogs, sample orders, or wholesale quotation details!<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" \u20ab"},"price_html":"","average_ratin