d":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/1466","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=1466&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":1461,"name":"Handcrafted Coconut Shell Bowl with Inlaid Mother of Pearl from Vietnam","slug":"handcrafted-coconut-shell-bowl-with-inlaid-mother-of-pearl-from-vietnam","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product\/handcrafted-coconut-shell-bowl-with-inlaid-mother-of-pearl-from-vietnam\/","sku":"VH2611","short_description":"","description":"<p data-path-to-node=\"2\"><b data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Handcrafted Coconut Shell Bowl with Inlaid Mother of Pearl \u2014 Eco-Friendly Artisanal Home Decor<\/b><\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">Elevate your product catalog with our handcrafted coconut shell bowl, featuring an iridescent mother-of-pearl (eggshell\/capiz shell) inner inlay. Expertly crafted by skilled Vietnamese artisans, this eco-friendly decorative piece combines sustainable natural materials with fine craftsmanship, making it an ideal addition for wholesalers, home decor importers, gift retailers, and hospitality suppliers.<\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Key Features &amp; Specifications<\/b><\/p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"5\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sustainable &amp; Eco-Friendly Materials:<\/b> Crafted from 100% natural, upcycled coconut shells and real shell inlay, offering an eco-conscious alternative to synthetic homeware.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Artisanal Craftsmanship:<\/b> Each bowl undergoes a meticulous process of shaping, sanding, inlaying, and polishing to achieve a smooth, high-luster inner finish while retaining its organic exterior texture.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Customizable Branding:<\/b> Ideal for souvenir and custom OEM\/ODM orders. The center plaque can be customized with your target city, brand logo, or custom lettering (e.g., &#8220;VIETNAM&#8221;, custom destinations, or private labels).<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Versatile Decorative Use:<\/b> Perfect as a key tray, trinket bowl, jewelry holder, table centerpiece, or decorative display piece for boutique hotels, resorts, and gift shops.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">B2B Order Details<\/b><\/p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Product Type:<\/b> Coconut Shell Decorative Bowl \/ Mother of Pearl Inlay Bowl<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Origin:<\/b> Vietnam<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Service Options:<\/b> OEM \/ ODM \/ Custom Logo Printing &amp; Engraving<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Supply Capacity:<\/b> Bulk order pricing and flexible Minimum Order Quantities (MOQ) available upon request.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,4,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Packaging:<\/b> Standard export-grade protective packaging to ensure safe international transit.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Partner With Us<\/b><\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">We specialize in high-quality handcraft