k of art.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Luxury &amp; Commercial Grade:<\/b> Built to meet export-quality standards. The sturdy weave resists warping, making it ideal for frequent use in commercial environments like fine-dining restaurants, boutique hotels, and luxury weddings.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Versatile Styling:<\/b> Perfect as a decorative base plate for dinnerware, a stylish serving tray, or a bohemian wall accent.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Technical Specifications<\/b><\/p>\n<table data-path-to-node=\"6\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Feature<\/strong><\/td>\n<td><strong>Specification<\/strong><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Material<\/b><\/span><\/td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,0\">100% Natural Rattan Core<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Craftsmanship<\/b><\/span><\/td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,0\">100% Handwoven<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Shape \/ Style<\/b><\/span><\/td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,0\">Round \/ Radial Basket Weave<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Color<\/b><\/span><\/td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,4,1,0\">Natural Warm Honey \/ Rattan Tone<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,5,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6,5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Usage<\/b><\/span><\/td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,5,1,0\">Fine Dining, Weddings, Hotels, Wholesale Home Decor<\/