 dining collections<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Why Partner With Us?<\/b><\/p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"5\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Custom Manufacturing:<\/b> We adapt dimensions, contours, and finishes to meet your specific market trends or brand guidelines.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Bulk Supply Capacity:<\/b> Reliable mass production with strict quality control ensuring uniformity across large order volumes.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sustainable Sourcing:<\/b> Responsibly harvested timber meeting international standards for eco-friendly craftsmanship.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">Contact our sales team today to request wholesale pricing, product samples, or to discuss custom OEM\/ODM specifications for your upcoming catalog.<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" \u20ab"},"price_html":"","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":1454,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH2608-wooden-bowl-made-in-Vietnam.jpg?fit=510%2C600&ssl=1","thumbnail":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH2608-wooden-bowl-made-in-Vietnam.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1","srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH2608-wooden-bowl-made-in-Vietnam.jpg?w=510&ssl=1 510w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH2608-wooden-bowl-made-in-Vietnam.jpg?resize=340%2C400&ssl=1 340w","sizes":"(max-width: 510px) 10