to-node=\"0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Handcrafted Natural Rattan Ball Coffee Table<\/b><\/p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"1\">\n<li>\n<p id=\"p-rc_461ff8bee958e254-23\" data-path-to-node=\"1,0,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"1,0,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"1,0,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sustainable &amp; Eco-Friendly:<\/b> Made from 100% natural, biodegradable rattan<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"1,0,0,2\">.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p id=\"p-rc_461ff8bee958e254-24\" data-path-to-node=\"1,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"1,1,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"1,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Artisanal Craftsmanship:<\/b> Hand-coiled by traditional Vietnamese artisans, blending organic aesthetics with durable structure<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"1,1,0,2\">.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p id=\"p-rc_461ff8bee958e254-25\" data-path-to-node=\"1,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"1,2,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"1,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Flexible OEM\/ODM Customization:<\/b> Fully customizable in dimensions, colors\/finishes, and packaging for B2B buyers<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"1,2,0,2\">.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p id=\"p-rc_461ff8bee958e254-26\" data-path-to-node=\"1,3,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"1,3,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"1,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Meaningful Social Impact:<\/b> Supports rural farming communities with off-season income and preserves traditional weaving culture<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"1,3,0,2\">.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>","description":"<h3 data-path-to-node=\"13\"><b data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Product Description<\/b><\/h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">Introduce timeless natural warmth, organic design, and sustainable craftsmanship to your furniture lineup with our signature <b data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"125\">Handcrafted Natural Rattan Ball Coffee Table<\/b>.<\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">Coiled meticulously from 100% natural rattan, this spherical accent table seamlessly serves as a central coffee table, side table, or statement ottoman. Designed specifically to meet the rigorous quality standards of international B2B buyers, this piece combines modern bohemian and eco-minimalist aesthetics with exceptional structural stability.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_1449\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-1449\" style=\"width: 1600px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"size-full wp-image-1449\" src=\"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH2609-Natural-rattan-furniture.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1163\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-1449\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Natural Rattan furniture made in Vietnam<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"17\"><b data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Key Points<\/b><\/h3>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"18\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">100% Eco-Friendly &amp; Sustainable Material:<\/b><\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,0,1\">Made entirely from sustainably harvested natural rattan. It is lightweight, biodegradable, and non-toxic, aligning perfectly with the global surge in consumer demand for sustainable and green interior decor.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Masterful Handcraftsmanship:<\/b><\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,1,1\">Each table is individually hand-coiled and assembled by skilled artisans. The unique concentric circle pattern provides a striking architectural structure while maintaining durability for long-term commercial or residential use.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Full OEM \/ ODM &amp; Customization Flexibility:<\/b><\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,2,1\">We offer comprehensive customization options to help you tailor products to your local market needs:<\/p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"18,2,2\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,2,2,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18,2,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Dimensions:<\/b> Custom diameter and height according to your specifications.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,2,2,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18,2,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Colors &amp; Finishes:<\/b> Natural raw rattan, honey brown, antique dark stain, matte black, or whitewash.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18,2,2,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18,2,2,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Branding &amp; Packaging:<\/b> Private labeling, custom master cartons, and drop-shipping compliant packaging.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"20\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">3. Our Core Values<\/b><\/h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"21\">When you partner with us, you purchase more than just premium furniture\u2014you invest in a sustainable community movement:<\/p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"22\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"22,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Rural Economic Empowerment:<\/b><\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22,0,1\">Our production model creates stable, supplementary employment for agricultural workers during off-season months when farming work is lean, providing vital extra income for rural families.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"22,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Preserving Cultural Heritage:<\/b><\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22,1,1\">By bringing these products to the international market, we actively support local artisan villages, helping to preserve century-old traditional hand-weaving techniques for future generations.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"24\"><b data-path-to-node=\"24\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">4. Technical Specifications<\/b><\/h3>\n<table data-path-to-node=\"25\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Feature<\/strong><\/td>\n<td><strong>Details<\/strong><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,1,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"25,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Material<\/b><\/span><\/td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,1,1,0\">100% Premium Natural Rattan \/ Cane<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,2,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"25,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Standard Size<\/b><\/span><\/td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,2,1,0\">Diameter: 60 cm | Height: 45 cm <i data-path-to-node=\"25,2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"32\">(Customizable)<\/i><\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,3,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"25,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Structure<\/b><\/span><\/td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,3,1,0\">Reinforced internal rattan frame for high load capacity<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,4,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"25,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Finish<\/b><\/span><\/td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,4,1,0\">Eco-friendly protective topcoat (Water-resistant &amp; Mold-resistant treatment)<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,5,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"25,5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Applications<\/b><\/span><\/td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,5,1,0\">Living rooms, boutique hotels, resort lounges, covered patios, cafes<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,6,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"25,6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Port of Loading<\/b><\/span><\/td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"25,6,1,0\">Hai Phong Port, Vietnam<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"27\"><b data-path-to-node=\"27\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">5. Why Partner With Vietnam Handicraft Co., Ltd?<\/b><\/h3>\n<ol start=\"1\" data-path-to-node=\"28\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"28,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"28,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Direct Factory Pricing:<\/b> Maximize your profit margins with competitive factory-direct wholesale pricing.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"28,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"28,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Scalable Production Capacity:<\/b> Consistent quality control and volume delivery for full container loads (FCL).<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"28,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"28,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Global Export Standards:<\/b> Complete experience in international shipping logistics, fumigation certification, and compliance standards.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"30\"><b data-path-to-node=\"30\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Call to Action<\/b><\/h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"31\"><b data-path-to-node=\"31\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Elevate your furniture collection today.<\/b> Contact our sales team to request a complete product catalog, request samples, or discuss custom OEM\/ODM specifications.<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" \u20ab"},"price_html":"","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":1446,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH2609-natural-rattan-table.jpg?fit=510%2C600&ssl=1","thumbnail":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH2609-natural-rattan-table.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1","srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH2609-natural-rattan-table.jpg?w=510&ssl=1 510w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH2609-natural-rattan-table.jpg?resize=340%2C400&ssl=1 340w","sizes":"(max-width: 510px) 100vw, 510px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/VH2609-natural-rattan-table.jpg?resize=280%2C280&ssl=1 280w, https:\/\/i0.wp.