"targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=1442&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":1433,"name":"Hand-Painted Natural Coconut Shell Bowl \u2013 Sea Turtle Edition","slug":"hand-painted-natural-coconut-shell-bowl-sea-turtle-edition","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product\/hand-painted-natural-coconut-shell-bowl-sea-turtle-edition\/","sku":"VH2607","short_description":"<p>Handcrafted from 100% natural, reclaimed coconut shells, this eco-friendly bowl features a vibrant hand-painted sea turtle design by skilled artisans. Smoothly polished with a non-toxic finish, it combines coastal charm with zero-waste sustainability. Ideal for smoothie bowls, snacks, or decorative displays. Available for OEM\/ODM custom branding, bespoke artwork, and bulk wholesale ordering directly from our factory in Vietnam.<\/p>","description":"<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">Elevate your eco-friendly dining and home decor collection with our exquisite <b data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"78\">Hand-Painted Natural Coconut Bowl<\/b>. Crafted from reclaimed coconut shells, each bowl is individually hand-painted by master artisans with a vibrant sea turtle and marine flora design. Seamlessly combining coastal charm, traditional craftsmanship, and eco-conscious design, this product is a standout addition for retailers, eco-boutiques, and hospitality suppliers.<\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"5\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Key Features &amp; Product Specifications<\/b><\/h3>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"6\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Material:<\/b> 100% Real, Reclaimed Coconut Shell (Eco-Friendly &amp; Biodegradable)<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Craftsmanship:<\/b> Hand-carved, smoothly sanded interior\/exterior, and hand-painted with food-grade, non-toxic lacquer.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Design:<\/b> Intricate sea turtle motif with aquatic green seaweed accents.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Surface Finish:<\/b> Smooth polished finish highlighting the raw, organic fiber texture of natural coconut.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Dimensions:<\/b> Diameter: 12 cm \u2013 15 cm | Height: 5.5 cm \u2013 6.5 cm <i data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"62\">(Natural variations occur)<\/i><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,5,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Usage:<\/b> Ideal for smoothie bowls, snacks, keys\/jewelry storage, decorative displays, or gift sets.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Why Partner With Us? (Direct Manufacturer Advantages)<\/b><\/h3>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"9\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Direct Vietnam Manufacturer:<\/b> Produced in our dedicated facility in Vietnam, allowing us to offer highly competitive factory-direct pricing without intermediary markups.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skilled Craftsmen &amp; Quality Control:<\/b> Every coconut shell is meticulously selected, smoothed, and painted by experienced artisans. Strict quality assurance ensures structural durability and a premium finish on every unit.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Bulk Production &amp; High Capacity:<\/b> We manage both low-minimum trial orders and high-volume container shipments with reliable, on-time delivery schedules.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Customization (OEM\/ODM):<\/b> We support custom hand-painted artwork, brand logo engraving, custom packaging, and specific finishing requests to fit your brand identity.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9,4,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">100% Sustainable &amp; Zero Waste:<\/b> Reclaiming discarded coconut shells supports a circular economy, offering your customers a stylish alternative to synthetic plastic homeware.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"11\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Target Market &amp; Ideal Buyers<\/b><\/h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">This product is highly sought after by:<\/p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Eco-Friendly &amp; Coastal Gift Shops<\/b><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Resorts, Hotels, &amp; Beachfront Restaurants<\/b><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Home Decor &amp; Sustainable Lifestyle Retailers<\/b><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"13,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Wholesale Importers &amp; Private Label Brands<\/b><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"15\"><b data-path-to-node=\"15\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Contact Us for Wholesale Quotes &amp; OEM Inquiries<\/b><\/h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16\">Partner directly with a trusted Vietnamese manufacturer to bring authentic, eco-friendly handicrafts to your retail lineup. Contact us today to request our full product catalog, order samples, or receive a tailored quotation.<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices