":false,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"N\/A","formatted_dimensions":"N\/A","add_to_cart":{"text":"Read more","description":"Read more about &ldquo;Hand-Painted Natural Coconut Shell Bowl \u2013 Sea Turtle Edition&rdquo;","url":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product\/hand-painted-natural-coconut-shell-bowl-sea-turtle-edition\/","single_text":"Add to cart","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/1433","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=1433&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":1428,"name":"Natural Acacia Wood Salad Servers Set made in Vietnam","slug":"natural-acacia-wood-salad-servers-set-made-in-vietnam","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product\/natural-acacia-wood-salad-servers-set-made-in-vietnam\/","sku":"VH2606","short_description":"<p>Handcrafted from 100% natural acacia wood, this rustic salad serving set features a unique twig-inspired handle design with a smooth, food-safe matte finish. Lightweight yet durable, it adds a touch of organic elegance to any dining or hospitality setting. Perfect for daily serving or commercial use. Custom branding, custom sizes, and bulk OEM\/ODM manufacturing are available.<\/p>","description":"<p data-path-to-node=\"0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Natural Acacia Wood Salad Servers Set \u2013 Handcrafted Serving Utensils<\/b><\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"1\">Enhance your kitchenware collection with our premium <b data-path-to-node=\"1\" data-index-in-node=\"53\">Acacia Wood Salad Server Set<\/b>. Skillfully handcrafted from 100% natural acacia wood, this set features a unique branch-inspired handle design that seamlessly blends rustic organic beauty with modern functionality. Finished with a food-safe matte coating, these utensils highlight the rich, natural grain patterns and warm tones of acacia while offering superior durability for daily commercial or home use.<\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\"><b data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Product Specifications<\/b><\/p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"4\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Material:<\/b> 100% Natural Acacia Wood (Acacia mangium \/ Acacia auriculiformis)<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Finish:<\/b> Food-grade, non-toxic matte lacquer \/ natural oil coating<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Set Includes:<\/b> 1x Salad Fork, 1x Salad Spoon \/ Spatula<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Design Feature:<\/b> Ergonomic twig-style handles with pre-drilled hanging holes<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4,4,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Color:<\/b> Warm natural brown with distinct grain contrast<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4,5,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Dimensions:<\/b> Customizable based on buyer requirements<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Why Partner With Us? (Direct Manufacturer Advantages)<\/b><\/p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Direct Factory &amp; Manufacturer:<\/b> As an established natural handicraft manufacturer, we eliminate middleman costs, providing competitive wholesale pricing directly from our production facility.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Skilled Artisans &amp; Quality Control:<\/b> Our experienced craftsmen pay meticulous attention to every detail\u2014from precision carving and smooth edge sanding to applying protective matte finishes that prevent moisture absorption and warping.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Custom &amp; Bulk Production (OEM\/ODM):<\/b> We cater to custom specifications, branding, packaging, and private label requests. Whether you require small-batch trial orders or large-scale container shipments, our flexible manufacturing lines adapt to your supply chain needs.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Eco-Friendly &amp; Sustainable:<\/b> Sourced from responsibly managed plantations, our wooden tableware offers an eco-conscious alternative to plastic utensils for eco-minded retailers and hospitality businesses.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Ideal For:<\/b> Wholesale distributors, kitchenware importers, boutique home decor brands, hotel &amp; restaurant chains, and corporate gift suppliers.<\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Contact Us for Wholesale Inquiries &amp; Price Quotes:<\/b><\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">Reach out today to request our full product catalog, sample sets, or custom OEM quotes for your business needs.<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" \u20ab"},"price_html"