o-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">100% Natural &amp; Sustainable Material:<\/b> Made from naturally harvested dried water hyacinth stems from Vietnam\u2014an eco-friendly, fast-renewable material that is safe for the home and environment.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sturdy Iron Frame Structure:<\/b> Reinforced with an internal metal\/iron frame, ensuring the basket retains its shape, withstands heavy daily use, and provides long-lasting durability.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Intricate Open-Weave Design:<\/b> Features an elegant open-knit pattern that creates a lightweight look while allowing air circulation, keeping stored items fresh and dry.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Handcrafted Excellence:<\/b> Every piece is uniquely woven by traditional Vietnamese artisans, giving each basket its own distinct character and craftsmanship quality.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,4,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Multi-Functional Utility:<\/b> Ideal for organizing blankets, toys, magazines, laundry, or home accessories. It can also serve as a decorative plant holder or stylish shelf organization bin.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"9\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Product Specifications<\/b><\/h3>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Item Code:<\/b> VH24035<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Material:<\/b> 100% Natural Dried Water Hyacinth + Sturdy Metal\/Iron Frame<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Origin:<\/b> Vietnam (Handmade by Vietcraft)<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Shape:<\/b> Oval \/ Round<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,4,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Color:<\/b> Natural Golden Warm Brown (Untreated natural tone)<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,5,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Usage:<\/b> Home Decor, Storage &amp; Organization, Plant Pot Cover, Hotel &amp; Resort Accessories<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,6,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10,6,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Customization:<\/b> Sizes, shapes, and weaving styles can be customized upon request for wholesale orders.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"12\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Why Choose Vietnam Handicraft Products?<\/b><\/h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13\">At <b data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"3\">Vietcraft<\/b>, we take pride in connecting traditional Vietnamese handicraft villages with the international market. Our products meet strict international quality control standards while supporting sustainable livelihoods for rural artisans across Vietnam.<\/p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"14\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">For B2B \/ Wholesale Enquiries:<\/b> We offer competitive FOB pricing, OEM\/ODM services, and scalable production capacities tailored to global importers, retailers, and interior designers.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"16\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Care Instructions<\/b><\/h3>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"17\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\">Keep in a dry, ventilated indoor environment.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\">Wipe clean with a soft, dry or slightly damp cloth.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0\">Avoid direct exposure to prolonged moisture or extreme sunlight to preserve natural colors and frame integrity.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19\"><b data-path-to-node=\"19\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Interested in wholesale pricing or custom specifications?<\/b> \ud83d\udce9 <b data-path-to-node=\"19\" data-index-in-node=\"61\">Contact Us:<\/b> vietcraft2006@gmail.com<\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20\">\ud83c\udf10 <b data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"3\">Website:<\/b> <a class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-hveid=\"0\" data-ved=\"0CAAQ_4QMahgKEwjU3tbA66aWAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQiQE\">https:\/\/vietcraft.vn<\/a><\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" \u20ab"},"price_html":"","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":1427,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/VH24035-Storage-basket-made-of-water-hyacinth-from-Vietnam.jpg?fit=510%2C600&ssl=1","thumbnail":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/VH24035-Storage-basket-made-of-water-hyacinth-from-Vietnam.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1","srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/VH24035-Storage-basket-made-of-water-hyacinth-from-Vietnam.jpg?w=510&ssl=1 510w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/VH24035-Storage-basket-made-of-water-hyacinth-from-Vietnam.jpg?resize=340%2C400&ssl=1 340w","sizes":"(max-width: 510px) 100vw, 510px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/VH24035-Storage-basket-made-of-water-hyacinth-from-Vietnam.jpg?resize=280%2C280&ssl=1 280w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/VH24035-Storage-basket-made-of-water-hyacinth-from-Vietnam.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/VH24035-Storage-basket-made-of-water-hyacinth-from-Vietnam.jpg?resize=100%2C100&ssl=1 100w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px","name":"VH24035-Storage-basket-made-of-water-hyacinth-from-Vietnam","alt":""}],"categories":[{"id":173,"name":"Basket","slug":"basket","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-category\/product-type\/storage-containers\/basket\/"},{"id":202,"name":"Home Living","slug":"home-living","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-category\/home-living\/"},{"id":70,"name":"Materials","slug":"materials","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-category\/materials\/"},{"id":167,"name":"Product Type","slug":"product-type","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-category\/product-type\/"},{"id":168,"name":"Storage &amp; Containers","slug":"storage-containers","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-category\/product-type\/storage-containers\/"},{"id":154,"name":"Water Hyacinth","slug":"water-hyacinth","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-category\/materials\/water-hyacinth\/"}],"tags":[{"id":1273,"name":"Water Hyacinth Storage Basket","slug":"water-hyacinth-storage-basket","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-tag\/water-hyacinth-storage-basket\/"},{"id":1277,"name":"Water Hyacinth Storage Basket factory","slug":"water-hyacinth-storage-basket-factory","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-tag\/water-hyacinth-storage-basket-factory\/"},{"id":1274,"name":"Water Hyacinth Storage Basket made in Vietnam","slug":"water-hyacinth-storage-basket-made-in-vietnam","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-tag\/water-hyacinth-storage-basket-made-in-vietnam\/"},{"id":1276,"name":"Water Hyacinth Storage Basket manufacturer","slug":"water-hyacinth-storage-basket-manufacturer","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-tag\/water-hyacinth-storage-basket-manufacturer\/"},{"id":1275,"name":"Water Hyacinth Storage Basket supplier","slug":"water-hyacinth-storage-basket-supplier","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-tag\/water-hyacinth-storage-basket-supplier\/"}],"brands":[],"attributes":[],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":false,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"N\/A","formatted_dimensions":"N\/A","add_to_cart":{"text":"Read more","description":"Read more about &ldquo;Eco-Friendly Handwoven Water Hyacinth Storage Basket with Iron Frame&rdquo;","url":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product\/eco-friendly-handwoven-water-hyacinth-storage-basket-with-iron-frame\/","single_text":"Add to cart","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/1423","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=1423&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":1416,"name":"Recycled Rubber Tire Log Basket from Vietnam","slug":"recycled-rubber-tire-log-basket-from-vietnam","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product\/recycled-rubber-tire-log-basket-from-vietnam\/","sku":"VH2605","short_description":"","description":"<h3 data-path-to-node=\"3\"><b data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Product Overview<\/b><\/h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">Elevate your eco-friendly product catalog with our <b data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"51\">Recycled Rubber Tire Log Basket<\/b> \u2014 a perfect blend of industrial durability, artisan craftsmanship, and sustainable design.<\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">Handcrafted from upcycled car tires, each basket transforms waste rubber into a functional, stylish, and virtually indestructible storage solution. Featuring distinctive contrast cross-stitching and reinforced handles, this versatile basket is designed to meet the demands of modern, eco-conscious consumers.<\/p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"7\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Key Features &amp; B2B Selling Points<\/b><\/h3>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">100% Upcycled &amp; Sustainable:<\/b> Made from discarded automotive tires, preventing rubber waste from reaching landfills and supporting a circular economy.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Extreme Durability &amp; Weather Resistance:<\/b> Inherently waterproof, rot-proof, and flexible. Unlike traditional canvas, plastic, or woven baskets, rubber won&#8217;t crack, tear, or succumb to outdoor elements.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Handcrafted Craftsmanship:<\/b> Each piece is carefully stripped, shaped, and hand-stitched by skilled rural artisans during off-peak agricultural seasons\u2014providing meaningful employment and supporting local livelihoods.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Heavy-Duty Load Capacity:<\/b> Reinforced with sturdy metal rivets and heavy-duty stitching, designed to transport heavy firewood, logs, gardening tools, or household supplies effortlessly.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Multipurpose Utility:<\/b> Ideal as a fireside log basket, garden harvest tote, indoor planter pot cover, toy organizer, or rustic home decor storage.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,5,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Unique Aesthetic:<\/b> The dark, textured rubber paired with prominent silver cross-stitching offers a bold, industrial-rustic appeal that fits modern, Scandinavian, and country-style interiors.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<figure id=\"attachment_1311\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-1311\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"size-full wp-image-1311\" src=\"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/vietnam-recycled-rubber-basket.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"850\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-1311\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Recycled rubber baskets made in Vietnam<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Product Specifications<\/b><\/h3>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"11\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Material:<\/b> 100% Upcycled Rubber Tire Sheets, Heavy-Duty Thread, Metal Rivets<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Color:<\/b> Charcoal Black \/ Dark Grey with Silver Accent Stitching<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Handles:<\/b> Dual reinforced rubber handles for easy carrying<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Finish:<\/b> Matte\/Semi-matte rubber texture<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11,4,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Cleaning &amp; Care:<\/b> Easy to wash with water and mild soap; low maintenance<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"13\"><b data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Why Partner With Us? (Wholesale Benefits)<\/b><\/h3>\n<ol start=\"1\" data-path-to-node=\"14\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">High Consumer Demand:<\/b> Sustainable home goods are growing rapidly worldwide. This product appeals strongly to eco-conscious shoppers and green living enthusiasts.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Impact-Driven Storytelling:<\/b> Our production model directly supports rural farming communities, giving your brand a powerful, ethical narrative to share with end customers.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"14,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Competitive Wholesale Pricing &amp; Flexible MOQs:<\/b> Optimized for retailers, home decor importers, garden centers, and eco-boutiques seeking strong profit margins.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"14,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Customization &amp; OEM Available:<\/b> Custom dimensions, stitching colors, or branding labels can be tailored for bulk orders.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"16\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Ideal Wholesale Buyers:<\/b><\/h3>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"17\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\">Fireplace &amp; Hearth Specialty Stores<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\">Garden Centers &amp; Hardware Distributors<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0\">Eco-Friendly \/ Fair Trade Retailers &amp; Boutiques<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,3,0\">Home Decor &amp; Interior Design Stockists<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,4,0\">Online Marketplaces &amp; E-commerce Brands<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19\"><b data-path-to-node=\"19\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Interested in adding this sustainable best-seller to your collection?<\/b><\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20\">\ud83d\udce9 <b data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"3\">Contact us today<\/b> for wholesale pricing, sample requests, catalog downloads, and bulk order inquiries!<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"pric