 growing base of eco-conscious consumers.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Artisanal Quality &amp; Durability:<\/b> Each frame is meticulously crafted by master Vietnamese artisans, featuring a sturdy build, clean weave finish, and long-lasting durability.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Versatile Decor Styles:<\/b> Fits seamlessly into Boho-chic, Scandinavian, Coastal, and Modern Rustic interior themes\u2014ideal for living rooms, entryways, bedrooms, or boutique hotel suites.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Factory-Direct B2B Pricing:<\/b> Enjoy competitive wholesale rates that maximize your profit margins while offering premium value to your retail clients.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Custom OEM\/ODM Solutions:<\/b> We offer customizable sizes, frame designs, and finishes to perfectly match your brand\u2019s unique product lineup.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1415\" src=\"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/VH2604-Rattan-mirror-P.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"1500\" \/><\/p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\">\ud83d\udccb Product Specifications at a Glance<\/h3>\n<table data-path-to-node=\"9\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Feature<\/strong><\/td>\n<td><strong>Specification<\/strong><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Material<\/b><\/span><\/td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,0\">Natural Rattan Frame + HD Glass Mirror<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Design Motif<\/b><\/span><\/td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,0\">Sunburst \/ Petal \/ Flower Accent<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Color Options<\/b><\/span><\/td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,3,1,0\">Natural Rattan, Warm Honey, or Custom Stains<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,4,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Ideal Buyers<\/b><\/span><\/td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,4,1,0\">Wholesalers, Distributors, Boutique Retailers, Hospitality Projects<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,5,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9,5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Export Readiness<\/b><\/span><\/td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,5,1,0\">Secure, export-standard packaging tailored for safe international shipping<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"11\">\ud83d\udce6 Partner with Vietnam Handicraft Today<\/h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">Expand your sustainable decor collection with high-demand rattan products manufactured directly at the source. We provide flexible order quantities, transparent lead times, and dedicated export support.<\/p>\n<blockquote data-path-to-node=\"13\">\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"13,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Request a Catalog &amp; B2B Quote:<\/b> Contact us today at\u00a0to request sample orders, wholesale price lists, or to discuss custom manufacturing for your upcoming seasonal collection!<\/p>\n<\/blockquote>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" \u20ab"},"price_html":"","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":1411,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-conte