decor\u2014it\u2019s a story told through craftsmanship.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Key Features &amp; Craftsmanship<\/strong><br \/>\n100% Eco-Friendly &amp; Sustainable: Crafted from upcycled coconut shells, giving natural materials a beautiful new life while reducing environmental waste.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Natural Exterior:<\/strong> The outer shell is carefully sanded and polished to a smooth finish, retaining its raw, warm, and authentic wooden texture.<\/p>\n<p>Exquisite Lacquer &amp; Hand-Painted Artwork: The interior features traditional lacquer work paired with meticulously hand-painted Vietnamese countryside landscapes\u2014capturing peaceful rural scenes, rustic houses, and calm waters.<br \/>\n<strong><br \/>\nUnique &amp; Handmade:<\/strong> Because every coconut is distinct and every landscape is painted by hand, no two bowls are ever completely identical. You are owning a truly one-of-a-kind art piece.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Perfect For Everyday Living<\/strong><br \/>\nHome Decor Highlight: A striking centerpiece for dining tables, coffee tables, or entryway consoles.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Functional Organizer:<\/strong> Ideal for holding keys, jewelry, trinkets, or small dry keepsakes.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Thoughtful Eco-Gift:<\/strong> A meaningful, handcrafted gift for friends, family, or foreign partners who appreciate sustainable lifestyle products and traditional art.<\/p>\n<p>Bring warmth, tradition, and sustainability into your home. Explore our collection today and support authentic local artisan craft!<\/p>\n<p><strong>Customization &amp; Wholesale Inquiries<\/strong><br \/>\nWe warmly welcome custom designs and bulk orders! Whether you are a retailer, wholesaler, or boutique brand looking for unique eco-friendly products, we are here to bring your vision to life.<\/p>\n<p>Customization Available: We can tailor the inner lacquer colors, hand-painted patterns, sizes, or custom branding\/logos according to your specific requirements.<\/p>\n<p>Get a Fast Quote: Have a specific project or inquiry in mind? Send us your requirements today, and our team will get back to you with a competitive price quote and detailed production lead time.<\/p>\n<p>\ud83d\udce9 Contact us today to request a quote or discuss your custom order!<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" \u20ab"},"price_html":"","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":1404,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/VH2603-hand-painted-coconut-bowl.jpg?fit=510%2C600&ssl=1","thumbnail":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/VH2603-hand-painted-coconut-bowl.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1","srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/VH2603-hand-painted-coconut-bowl.jpg?w=510&ssl=1 510w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/VH2603-hand-painted-coconut-bowl.jpg?resize=340%2C400&ssl=1 340w","sizes":"(max-width: 510px) 100vw, 510px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/VH2603-hand-painted-coconut-bowl.jpg?resize=280%2C280&ssl=1 280w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/VH2603-hand-painted-coconut-bowl.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/VH2603-hand-painted-coconut-bowl.jpg?resize=100%2C100&ssl=1 100w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px","name":"VH2603-hand-painted-coconut-bowl","alt":""},{"id":1406,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/VH2603-coconut-shell-bowl-outside.jpg?fit=510%2C600&ssl=1","thumbnail":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/VH2603-coconut-shell-bowl-outside.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1