,"slug":"handwoven-bamboo-box-with-lid-factory","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-tag\/handwoven-bamboo-box-with-lid-factory\/"},{"id":1252,"name":"Handwoven Bamboo Box with Lid made in Vietnam","slug":"handwoven-bamboo-box-with-lid-made-in-vietnam","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-tag\/handwoven-bamboo-box-with-lid-made-in-vietnam\/"},{"id":1251,"name":"Handwoven Bamboo Box with Lid manufacturer","slug":"handwoven-bamboo-box-with-lid-manufacturer","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-tag\/handwoven-bamboo-box-with-lid-manufacturer\/"},{"id":1249,"name":"Handwoven Bamboo Box with Lid supplier","slug":"handwoven-bamboo-box-with-lid-supplier","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-tag\/handwoven-bamboo-box-with-lid-supplier\/"},{"id":747,"name":"sustainable decor","slug":"sustainable-decor","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-tag\/sustainable-decor\/"},{"id":1245,"name":"tabletop-storage","slug":"tabletop-storage","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-tag\/tabletop-storage\/"}],"brands":[],"attributes":[],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":false,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"N\/A","formatted_dimensions":"N\/A","add_to_cart":{"text":"Read more","description":"Read more about &ldquo;Handwoven Bamboo Box with Lid&rdquo;","url":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product\/handwoven-bamboo-box-with-lid\/","single_text":"Add to cart","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/1379","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=1379&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":1373,"name":"Hand-Carved Red Wood Halloween Spoons made in Vietnam","slug":"hand-carved-red-wood-halloween-spoons-made-in-vietnam","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product\/hand-carved-red-wood-halloween-spoons-made-in-vietnam\/","sku":"VH2601","short_description":"<p>Handcrafted from 100% natural Vietnamese Red Wood (G\u1ed7 G\u00f5 \u0110\u1ecf), this festive set of 3 Halloween spoons features detailed hand-carved motifs: an Acorn, a Pumpkin, and a Jack-o&#8217;-Lantern Witch. Each piece is meticulously hand-sanded to a silky-smooth, food-safe finish\u2014perfect for autumn tea time, festive dessert serving, or seasonal gifting.<\/p>","description":"<p>\ud83c\udf42 <strong>Product Description<\/strong><br \/>\n<em>Bring Autumn Magic &amp; Spooky Charm to Your Table!<\/em><br \/>\nElevate your autumn table settings and Halloween tea parties with our Hand-Carved Red Wood Halloween Spoon Collection. Skillfully crafted from premium natural Vietnamese Red Wood, each spoon features a uniquely sculpted stem topped with detailed fall and festive motifs: a classic Acorn with Leaves, a cozy Harvest Pumpkin, and a spooky Jack-o&#8217;-Lantern with a Witch Hat.<\/p>\n<p>Every spoon is 100% hand-carved and hand-sanded by skilled artisans, ensuring a silky-smooth, comfortable feel without any rough edges while highlighting the warm, rich reddish-brown wood grain.<\/p>\n<p><strong>\u2728 Key Features:<\/strong><br \/>\nPremium Natural Material: Made from natural Vietnamese Red Wood (G\u1ed7 G\u00f5 \u0110\u1ecf), famous for its high density, outstanding durability, and rich, glowing finish.<\/p>\n<p>100% Artisan Handcrafted: Meticulously hand-carved and fine-sanded for a smooth, splinter-free touch and natural organic texture.<\/p>\n<p>3 Iconic Festive Designs:<\/p>\n<p>\ud83c\udf30 The Acorn &amp; Leaf: A symbol of autumn abundance and rustic warmth.<\/p>\n<p>\ud83c\udf83 The Harvest Pumpkin: Classic fall aesthetic for daily coffee or tea time.<\/p>\n<p>\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2640\ufe0f The Witch Jack-o&#8217;-Lantern: Fun, spooky, and perfect for Halloween gatherings.<\/p>\n<p>Food-Safe &amp; Eco-Friendly: Finished with natural food-safe oil that protects the wood while preserving its natural aroma and luster.<\/p>\n<p>Versatile &amp; Decorative: Perfect for stirring coffee, tea, potion drinks, eating desserts, or as a unique festive prop and autumn kitchen gift.<\/p>\n<p><strong>\ud83d\udcd0 Product Specifications:<\/strong><br \/>\nMaterial: 100% Natural Red Wood (G\u1ed7 G\u00f5 \u0110\u1ecf)<\/p>\n<p>Craftsmanship: Hand-carved &amp; Hand-sanded<\/p>\n<p>Set Includes: 3 Spoons (Acorn, Pumpkin, Witch Jack-o&#8217;-Lantern)<\/p>\n<p>Finish: Natural food-safe finish<\/p>\n<p>Care Instructions: Hand wash with mild soap and warm water. Dry immediately. Do not soak or put in the dishwasher\/microwave.<\/p>\n<p><b data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Custom Designs Available:<\/b> If you have any special requirements or custom designs in mind, please feel free to contact us! We can produce and manufacture custom wooden items according to your exact specifications, drawings, or sample requests.<\/p>\n<p>Wooden Halloween Spoons, Red Wood Spoons, Hand Carved Wooden Spoon, Go Go Do Woodcraft, Pumpkin Spoon, Jack o Lantern Spoon, Witch Hat Spoon, Halloween Kitchen Decor, Artisan Coffee Spoon, Fall Tableware Gift<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" \u20ab"},"price_html":"","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":1377,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/VH2601-Wooden-Halloween-Spoons.jpg?fit=510%2C600&ssl=1","thumbnail":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/VH2601-Wooden-Halloween-Spoons.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1","srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/VH2601-Wooden-Halloween-Spoons.jpg?w=510&ssl=1 510w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/VH2601-Wooden-Halloween-Spoons.jpg?resize=340%2C400&ssl=1 340w","sizes":"(max-width: 510px) 100vw, 510px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/VH2601-Wooden-Halloween-Spoons.jpg?resize=280%2C280&ssl=1 280w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/VH2601-Wooden-Halloween-Spoons.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/VH2601-Wooden-Halloween-Spoons.jpg?resize=100%2C100&ssl=1 100w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px","name":"VH2601-Wooden-Halloween-Spoons","alt":""}],"categories":[{"id":205,"name":"Gift &amp; Craft","slug":"gift-craft","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-category\/home-living\/gift-craft\/"},{"id":202,"name":"Home Living","slug":"home-living","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-category\/home-living\/"},{"id":207,"name":"Hotel &amp; Restaurant","slug":"hotel-restaurant","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-category\/home-living\/hotel-restaurant\/"},{"id":206,"name":"Kitchen Accessories","slug":"kitchen-accessories","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-category\/home-living\/kitchen-accessories\/"},{"id":70,"name":"Materials","slug":"materials","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-category\/materials\/"},{"id":167,"name":"Product Type","slug":"product-type","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-category\/product-type\/"},{"id":181,"name":"Spoon \/ Fork \/ Knife","slug":"spoon-fork-knife","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-category\/product-type\/tableware-dining\/spoon-fork-knife\/"},{"id":209,"name":"Tableware","slug":"tableware","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-category\/home-living\/tableware\/"},{"id":169,