ing or decorative accents.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Commercial Advantages &amp; Production Specifications<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>We understand the wholesale buyer\u2019s need for consistency, scalability, and competitive pricing.<br \/>\n<strong>Material &amp; Quality:<\/strong> 100% Natural, Sustainably Sourced Rattan: Guaranteed durability and environmental compliance, appealing to the modern consumer market&#8217;s focus on eco-responsibility. Each piece undergoes a rigorous quality control process to ensure uniformity in weave density, color tone, and finished dimensions.<br \/>\n<strong>Craftsmanship Expert Hand-Woven Construction:<\/strong> Leveraging generations of Vietnamese weaving expertise to ensure a high-end, artisan finish. The oval shape offers maximum utility while maintaining a distinct, marketable aesthetic.<br \/>\n<strong>Scalability High Production Capacity:<\/strong> We maintain a flexible supply chain capable of fulfilling large-volume orders (bulk purchasing) on a consistent, year-round basis. Production lead times are managed efficiently to meet global shipping schedules.<br \/>\n<strong>Customization Private Label &amp; OEM Services:<\/strong> We offer options for custom sizing, minor design modifications, and private labeling (hang tags, packaging inserts, or engraving) to meet your specific brand requirements.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Partnership &amp; Logistics<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Minimum Order Quantity (MOQ):<\/strong> Please inquire for our current MOQ structure. We offer tiered pricing for larger volume commitments.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Packaging:<\/strong> Standard packaging includes moisture-resistant wrapping and master cartons optimized for international freight to minimize damage and volumetric weight.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Inquire Today:<\/strong> To request a detailed product catalog, discuss our current price list, and obtain samples, please contact our B2B sales team at vietcraft2006@gmail.com &#8211;\u00a0 or call us at +84 975810168<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" \u20ab"},"price_html":"","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":1294,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/VH24040-oval-rattan-fruit-basket.jpg?fit=510%2C600&ssl=1","thumbnail":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/VH24040-oval-rattan-fruit-basket.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1","srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/VH24040-oval-rattan-fruit-basket.jpg?w=510&ssl=1 510w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/VH24040-oval-rattan-fruit-basket.jpg?resize=340%2C400&ssl=1 340w","sizes":"(max-width: 510px) 100vw, 510px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/VH24040-oval-rattan-fruit-basket.jpg?resize=280%2C280&ssl=1 280w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/VH24040-oval-rattan-fruit-basket.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/VH24040-oval-rattan-fruit-basket.jpg?resize=100%2C100&ssl=1 100w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px","name":"VH24040-oval-rattan-fruit-basket","alt":""},{"id":1271,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/VH24040-oval-rattan-fruit-basket-Vietnam.jpg?fit=1080%2C1080&ssl=1","thumbnail":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/VH24040-oval-rattan-fruit-basket-Vietnam.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1","srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/VH24040-oval-rattan-fruit-basket-Vietnam.jpg?w=1080&ssl=1 1080w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/VH24040-oval-rattan-fruit-basket-Vietnam.jpg