 class=\"rnc2Gd\" data-ast-node-id=\"3\">\u00a0is the perfect blend of traditional artistry and modern, eco-conscious living.<\/span><\/p>","description":"<p><br \/>\nHandcrafted for Protection and Style<\/p>\n<p>Made entirely in Vietnam, this food tent is a sustainable upgrade from plastic covers and flimsy mesh domes.<\/p>\n<p>Natural &amp; Sustainable:\u00a0Expertly woven from 100% natural bamboo\u2014a fast-growing, renewable resource that is lightweight yet incredibly durable.<br \/>\nArtisan Quality:\u00a0Each tent is\u00a0handwoven\u00a0by Vietnamese artisans, whose weaving techniques ensure a tight, effective barrier against insects while allowing air circulation.<br \/>\nCharming Design:\u00a0The natural color and unique, tightly-woven structure add a rustic, beautiful touch to any outdoor gathering, picnic, or kitchen counter.<\/p>\n<p>Perfect for Any Occasion<\/p>\n<p>Its functional design makes it a versatile tool for any home or outdoor event.<\/p>\n<p>Outdoor Dining:\u00a0The essential accessory for your summer BBQs, picnics, and patio parties to keep pests away from your salads, fruit bowls, and baked goods.<br \/>\nKitchen Counter:\u00a0Use it to cover rising dough, fresh bread, or produce.<br \/>\nEasy Storage:\u00a0Lightweight and often designed to be easily stored or hung.<\/p>\n<p>Choose the Bamboo Food Tent for an attractive, effective, and environmentally responsible way to protect your food. You&#8217;re supporting sustainable craft and bringing a piece of Vietnamese tradition to your table.<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" \u20ab"},"price_html":"","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":640,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/VH25024-bamboo-food-tent.jpg?fit=510%2C600&ssl=1","thumbnail":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/VH25024-bamboo-food-tent.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1","srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/VH25024-bamboo-food-tent.jpg?w=510&ssl=1 510w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/VH25024-bamboo-food-tent.jpg?resize=340%2C400&ssl=1 340w","sizes":"(max-width: 510px) 100vw, 510px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/VH25024-bamboo-food-tent.jpg?resize=280%2C280&ssl=1 280w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/VH25024-bamboo-food-tent.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/VH25024-bamboo-food-tent.jpg?resize=100%2C100&ssl=1 100w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px","name":"VH25024-bamboo-food-tent","alt":""}],"categories":[{"id":71,"name":"Bamboo","slug":"bamboo","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-category\/materials\/bamboo\/"},{"id":173,"name":"Basket","slug":"basket","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-category\/product-type\/storage-containers\/basket\/"},{"id":202,"name":"Home Living","slug":"home-living","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-category\/home-living\/"},{"id":206,"name":"Kitchen Accessories","slug":"kitchen-accessories","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-category\/home-living\/kitchen-accessories\/"},{"id":70,"name":"Materials","slug":"materials","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-category\/materials\/"},{"id":167,"name":"Product Type","slug":"product-type","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-category\/product-type\/"},{"id":168,"name":"Storage &amp; Containers","slug":"storage-containers","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-category\/product-type\/storage-containers\/"}],"tags":[{"id":1158,"name":"Bamboo food tent","slug":"bamboo-food-tent","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-tag\/bamboo-food-tent\/