for hotels, restaurants, and home decor.<\/p>","description":"<h3 data-start=\"197\" data-end=\"227\"><strong data-start=\"201\" data-end=\"225\">Product Description:<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"228\" data-end=\"488\">This <strong data-start=\"233\" data-end=\"263\">woven bamboo pendant light<\/strong> is a perfect blend of traditional craftsmanship and modern design. Each pendant is <strong data-start=\"347\" data-end=\"393\">handcrafted by skilled Vietnamese artisans<\/strong> using natural bamboo \u2014 a renewable, eco-friendly material known for its strength and beauty.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"490\" data-end=\"789\">The natural weaving pattern creates a warm, diffused glow, making it ideal for <strong data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"621\">restaurants, hotels, resorts, and home interiors<\/strong> that seek a cozy, tropical, or bohemian atmosphere. Every piece is unique, highlighting the artisanal charm and cultural heritage of Vietnam\u2019s bamboo craft villages.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"1069\">At <strong data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"825\">Vietnam Handicraft Co., Ltd<\/strong>, we specialize in producing and exporting <strong data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"902\">bamboo lighting and home decor<\/strong> products. We supply to importers, distributors, and interior design brands worldwide, offering <strong data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1036\">custom shapes, sizes, and finishes<\/strong> for bulk and wholesale orders.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1306\"><strong data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1110\">Supplier &amp; Manufacturer in Vietnam:<\/strong><br data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1113\" \/>We provide high-quality, handmade bamboo pendant lamps, sustainably sourced and crafted in Vietnam.<br data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1215\" \/>\ud83d\udce9 Contact: <strong data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1254\"><a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1252\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com<\/a><\/strong> | \ud83c\udf10 <a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1260\" data-end=\"1304\">https:\/\/vietcraft.vn<\/a><\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1331\"><strong data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1329\">Key Features:<\/strong><\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1596\">\n<li data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1365\">\n<p data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1365\">Material: 100% Natural Bamboo<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1397\">\n<p data-start=\"1368\" data-end=\"1397\">Origin: Handmade in Vietnam<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1430\">\n<p data-start=\"1400\" data-end=\"1430\">Eco-friendly and sustainable<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1484\">\n<p data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1484\">Beautiful light diffusion through natural weaving<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1546\">\n<p data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1546\">Suitable for home, restaurant, hotel, or resort interiors<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1596\">\n<p data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1596\">Custom designs available for wholesale orders<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1972\">","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" \u20ab"},"price_html":"","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":1214,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/VH24047-woven-bamboo-pendant-made-in-Vietnam.jpg?fit=510%2C600&ssl=1","thumbnail":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/VH24047-woven-bamboo-pendant-made-in-Vietnam.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1","srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/VH24047-woven-bamboo-pendant-made-in-Vietnam.jpg?w=510&ssl=1 51