iece is carefully woven by hand, showcasing the delicate craftsmanship and cultural heritage of Vietnam\u2019s traditional craft villages. The tray is lightweight yet durable, ideal for serving, organizing, or decorating your home.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"586\" data-end=\"820\">Made from sustainably sourced rattan, this product is eco-friendly and adds a warm, natural touch to any interior. With smooth finishing and elegant weaving patterns, it perfectly suits modern, rustic, or tropical home d\u00e9cor styles.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"1071\">At <strong data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"856\">Vietnam Handicraft Co., Ltd<\/strong>, we produce and export a wide range of handmade rattan trays for hotels, resorts, restaurants, and home decor brands worldwide. We also offer <strong data-start=\"999\" data-end=\"1038\">custom sizes, colors, and packaging<\/strong> for wholesale and bulk orders.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1073\" data-end=\"1379\"><strong data-start=\"1073\" data-end=\"1112\">Supplier &amp; Manufacturer in Vietnam:<\/strong><br data-start=\"1112\" data-end=\"1115\" \/>We provide high-quality, handmade rattan trays made from natural materials. Bulk and wholesale options available for importers, decorators, and homeware brands.<br data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1278\" \/>\ud83d\udce9 Contact us at <strong data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1322\"><a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1320\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com<\/a><\/strong> or visit <a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1376\">https:\/\/vietcraft.vn<\/a>.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1404\"><strong data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1402\">Key Features:<\/strong><\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1405\" data-end=\"1642\">\n<li data-start=\"1405\" data-end=\"1438\">\n<p data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1438\">Material: 100% Natural Rattan<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1439\" data-end=\"1470\">\n<p data-start=\"1441\" data-end=\"1470\">Origin: Handmade in Vietnam<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1471\" data-end=\"1503\">\n<p data-start=\"1473\" data-end=\"1503\">Eco-friendly and sustainable<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1504\" data-end=\"1556\">\n<p data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1556\">Available in round, oval, and rectangular shapes<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1604\">\n<p data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1604\">Lightweight, durable, and multi-purpose use<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1605\" data-end=\"1642\">\n<p data-start=\"1607\" data-end=\"1642\">Customizable for wholesale orders<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"1644\" data-end=\"1672\"><\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1673\" data-end=\"1845\">\n<p data-start=\"2017\" data-end=\"2142\">","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" \u20ab"},"price_html":"","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":1209,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/VH24048-woven-rattan-tray-in-Vietnam.jpg?fit=510%2C600&ssl=1","thumbnail":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/VH24048-woven-rattan-tray-in-Vietnam.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1","srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/VH24048-woven-rattan-tray-in-Vietnam.jpg?w=510&ssl=1 510w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/VH24048-woven-rattan-tray-in-Vietnam.jpg?resize=340%2C400&ssl=1 340w","sizes":"(max-width: 510px) 100vw, 510px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/VH24048-woven-rattan-tray-in-Vietnam.jpg?resize=280%2C280&ssl=1 280w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/VH24048-woven-rattan-tray-in-Vietnam.jpg?r