\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=1195&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":1188,"name":"Jute Hanging Lampshade from Vietnam","slug":"jute-hanging-lampshade-from-vietnam","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product\/jute-hanging-lampshade-from-vietnam\/","sku":"VH24050","short_description":"<p>Handmade jute hanging lampshades from Vietnam \u2013 eco-friendly, stylish, and perfect for natural interior design. Wholesale &amp; custom orders available.<\/p>","description":"<h2 data-start=\"1639\" data-end=\"1648\">Vietnam is a trusted source for <strong data-start=\"254\" data-end=\"281\">jute hanging lampshades<\/strong>, handmade by artisans using natural jute fiber. These lampshades create a warm, eco-friendly glow, ideal for <strong data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"432\">homes, caf\u00e9s, restaurants, and hotels<\/strong>.<\/h2>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1194\" src=\"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/VH24050-Jute-hanging-lamshade-from-Vietnam-L.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1080\" \/><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"210\" data-end=\"537\">Our <strong data-start=\"214\" data-end=\"241\">jute hanging lampshades<\/strong> are crafted by skilled artisans in Vietnam, using natural jute fibers that bring a warm and organic touch to any space. The natural weave creates a soft, ambient glow, making these lampshades perfect for <strong data-start=\"446\" data-end=\"534\">living rooms, dining areas, caf\u00e9s, restaurants, and eco-friendly home d\u00e9cor projects<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"539\" data-end=\"735\">Available in various shapes and sizes (round, bell, drum, cone), our jute lampshades combine <strong data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"671\">sustainability with timeless design<\/strong>. Each piece is lightweight, durable, and completely handmade.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"958\">By choosing our products, you not only get beautiful and functional lighting, but also support Vietnamese craft villages, helping local artisans earn a sustainable income while preserving traditional weaving techniques.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"1204\"><strong data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"999\">Supplier &amp; Manufacturer in Vietnam:<\/strong><br data-start=\"999\" data-end=\"1002\" \/>Vietnam Handicraft Co., Ltd provides <strong data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1068\">wholesale jute lampshades<\/strong> with custom designs, OEM branding, and international shipping. We work with importers, retailers, and hospitality projects worldwide.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"1204\">As a <strong data-start=\"442\" data-end=\"507\">jute lampshade manufacturer and wholesale supplier in Vietnam<\/strong>, we provide bulk orders, custom designs, and international shipping.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1285\">\ud83d\udce9 For wholesale inquiries, please contact us at <strong data-start=\"1255\" data-end=\"1282\"><a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1280\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com<\/a><\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1465\">\n<p data-start=\"580\" data-end=\"621\">","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" \u20ab"},"price_html":"","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":1192,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/VH24050-Jute-hanging-lamshade-from-Vietnam-P.jpg?fit=1000%2C1500&ssl=1","thumbnail":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/VH24050-Jute-hanging-lamshade-from-Vietnam-P.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1","srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/VH24050-Jute-hanging-lamshade-from-Vietnam-P.jpg?w=1000&ssl=1 1000w, https:\/\/i0.wp.c