escription":"<p>Handmade spun bamboo bowls from Vietnam \u2013 eco-friendly, lightweight, and durable. Perfect for serving or decoration. Wholesale &amp; custom design available.<\/p>","description":"<p data-start=\"221\" data-end=\"472\">Vietnam is well-known for its <strong data-start=\"251\" data-end=\"272\">spun bamboo bowls<\/strong>, handmade by artisans using traditional coiling techniques. Lightweight, durable, and eco-friendly, these bowls are ideal for <strong data-start=\"399\" data-end=\"434\">serving salad, fruit, or snacks<\/strong>, as well as stylish <strong data-start=\"455\" data-end=\"469\">home d\u00e9cor<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"241\" data-end=\"466\">Our <strong data-start=\"245\" data-end=\"266\">spun bamboo bowls<\/strong> are handcrafted in Vietnam using the traditional coiling technique. Each bowl is made from layers of natural bamboo, carefully spun and polished to create a smooth, durable, and lightweight finish.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"468\" data-end=\"722\">These bowls are not only functional for <strong data-start=\"508\" data-end=\"543\">serving salad, fruit, or snacks<\/strong>, but also bring a natural touch to home d\u00e9cor. Available in <strong data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"647\">natural, lacquered, or painted finishes<\/strong>, spun bamboo bowls are perfect for both modern and traditional settings.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"966\">By choosing our products, you support Vietnamese artisans and contribute to <strong data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"822\">sustainable living<\/strong>, as bamboo is a fast-growing, eco-friendly material. We also accept <strong data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"914\">OEM &amp; custom orders<\/strong> with your own designs, colors, and logo branding.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1184\"><strong data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1007\">Supplier &amp; Manufacturer in Vietnam:<\/strong><br data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1010\" \/>Vietnam Handicraft Co., Ltd specializes in wholesale bamboo tableware and home d\u00e9cor. We export worldwide with competitive prices, flexible MOQ, and international shipping.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1184\">As a trusted <strong data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"549\">bamboo bowl manufacturer and wholesale supplier in Vietnam<\/strong>, we provide bulk orders, OEM customization, and international shipping.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1255\">\ud83d\udce9 For inquiries, please contact us at <strong data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1252\"><a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1250\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com<\/a><\/strong>.<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" \u20ab"},"price_html":"","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":1187,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/VH24051-spun-bamboo-bowl.jpg?fit=510%2C600&ssl=1","thumbnail":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/VH24051-spun-bamboo-bowl.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1","srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/VH24051-spun-bamboo-bowl.jpg?w=510&ssl=1 510w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/VH24051-spun-bamboo-bowl.jpg?resize=340%2C400&ssl=1 340w","sizes":"(max-width: 510px) 100vw, 510px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/VH24051-spun-bamboo-bowl.jpg?resize=280%2C280&ssl=1 280w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/VH24051-spun-bamboo-bowl.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/VH24051-spun-bamboo-bowl.jpg?resize=100%2C100&ssl=1 100w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px","nam