 making it a perfect choice for serving fruits, bread, or snacks at home, in restaurants, or for d\u00e9cor display.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"596\" data-end=\"777\">Crafted in Vietnam\u2019s renowned craft villages, this bamboo bowl reflects the harmony of nature and craftsmanship, while supporting sustainable living and rural artisan communities.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_1162\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-1162\" style=\"width: 1080px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"size-full wp-image-1162\" src=\"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/VH24053-oval-spun-bamboo-bowl-manufacturer.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1080\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-1162\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Spun bamboo manufacturer in Vietnam<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1156\">We can produce this bamboo bowl in <strong data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1094\">different sizes, finishes, or customized designs<\/strong> based on your requirements for wholesale and export orders.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1437\">\ud83d\udc49 <strong data-start=\"1161\" data-end=\"1200\">Supplier &amp; Manufacturer in Vietnam:<\/strong><br data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1203\" \/>We provide high-quality bamboo handicrafts with bulk and wholesale options for retailers, distributors, and decorators. For inquiries or custom designs, please contact us at <strong data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1404\"><a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1402\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com<\/a><\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"779\" data-end=\"798\"><strong data-start=\"779\" data-end=\"796\">Key Features:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"1026\">\n<li data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"832\">\n<p data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"832\">Material: 100% natural bamboo<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"872\">\n<p data-start=\"835\" data-end=\"872\">Technique: Hand-coiled and polished<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"924\">\n<p data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"924\">Finish: Smooth, food-safe, eco-friendly coating<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"991\">\n<p data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"991\">Usage: Ideal for fruits, snacks, bread, or decorative purposes<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1026\">\n<p data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1026\">Origin: Handcrafted in Vietnam<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1168\">","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" \u20ab"},"price_html":"","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":1158,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/VH24053-oval-spun-bamboo-bowl.jpg?fit=510%2C600&ssl=1","thumbnail":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/VH24053-oval-spun-bamboo-bowl.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1","srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/VH24053-oval-spun-bamboo-bowl.jpg?w=510&ssl=1 510w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/VH24053-oval-spun-bamboo-bowl.jpg?resize=340%2C400&ssl=1 340w","sizes":"(max-width: 510px) 100vw, 510px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/VH24053-oval-spun-bamboo-bowl.jpg?resize=280%2C280&ssl=1 280w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/VH24053-oval-spun-bamboo-bowl.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/VH24053-oval-spun-bamboo-bowl.jpg?resize=100%2C100&ssl=1 100w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px","name":"VH24053-oval-spun-bamboo-bowl","alt":""},{"id":1160,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.v