,"parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product\/wicker-storage-basket-made-in-vietnam-wholesale-manufacturer-supplier\/","sku":"VH24057","short_description":"<p>Handmade <strong data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1677\">wicker storage baskets from Vietnam<\/strong>, eco-friendly and durable, available for wholesale importers, retailers, and home d\u00e9cor suppliers.<\/p>","description":"<h2 data-start=\"182\" data-end=\"207\">Product Description:<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"208\" data-end=\"478\">Our <strong data-start=\"212\" data-end=\"238\">wicker storage baskets<\/strong> are handcrafted in Vietnam using natural, eco-friendly wicker, woven by skilled artisans from traditional craft villages. Each basket is durable, lightweight, and designed to bring both functionality and rustic charm to any living space.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"817\">Perfect for organizing clothes, toys, magazines, or home essentials, these baskets add a natural aesthetic to homes, hotels, restaurants, and retail shops. With custom sizes and finishes available, our wicker baskets are a sustainable alternative to plastic storage, making them an ideal choice for importers and wholesalers worldwide.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"1029\">By working with us, you are supporting Vietnam\u2019s rural communities, helping farmers earn additional income during their free time, while preserving cultural heritage and creating export value for the country.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1260\"><strong data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1070\">Supplier &amp; Manufacturer in Vietnam:<\/strong><br data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1073\" \/>We provide high-quality wicker storage baskets with bulk and wholesale options for retailers, decorators, and importers. For inquiries, please contact us at <strong data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1257\"><a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1255\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com<\/a><\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h2 data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1280\">Key Features:<\/h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1603\">\n<li data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1344\">\n<p data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1344\">Material: 100% natural wicker, eco-friendly and sustainable<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1388\">\n<p data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1388\">Handmade by skilled Vietnamese artisans<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1430\">\n<p data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1430\">Sturdy, lightweight, and long-lasting<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1496\">\n<p data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1496\">Multipurpose: clothing, toys, books, kitchen items, and d\u00e9cor<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1497\" data-end=\"1559\">\n<p data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1559\">Custom sizes, shapes, and finishes available for wholesale<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1560\" data-end=\"1603\">\n<p data-start=\"1562\" data-end=\"1603\">Perfect for home, hotel, and retail use<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1629\" data-end=\"1778\">\n<p data-start=\"1959\" data-end=\"2102\">","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" \u20ab"},"price_html":"","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":1111,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/VH24057-wicker-storage-basket-made-vietnam.jpg?fit=510%2C600&ssl=1","thumbnail":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/VH24057-wicker-storage-basket-made-vietnam.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1","srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/VH24057-wicker-storage-basket-made-vietnam.jpg?w=510&ssl=1 510w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/VH24057-wicker-