e is made from sustainably sourced wicker, carefully woven by hand to create unique textures and patterns.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"486\" data-end=\"717\">These wicker lampshades not only provide warm, cozy lighting but also reflect Vietnam\u2019s long tradition of craftsmanship. Perfect for restaurants, cafes, hotels, and home interiors, they are lightweight, eco-friendly, and durable.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"997\">By choosing our products, you are supporting local Vietnamese craft villages, creating jobs for rural farmers during their free time, and helping preserve cultural heritage. Our wicker lampshades are available in bulk and wholesale, with custom sizes and designs upon request.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"999\" data-end=\"1226\"><strong data-start=\"999\" data-end=\"1038\">Supplier &amp; Manufacturer in Vietnam:<\/strong><br data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1041\" \/>We provide high-quality wicker lighting products, offering wholesale options for retailers, decorators, and importers. For inquiries, please contact us at <strong data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1223\"><a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1221\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com<\/a><\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h2 data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1246\">Key Features:<\/h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1590\">\n<li data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1310\">\n<p data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1310\">Material: 100% natural wicker, eco-friendly and sustainable<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1354\">\n<p data-start=\"1313\" data-end=\"1354\">Handmade by skilled Vietnamese artisans<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1391\">\n<p data-start=\"1357\" data-end=\"1391\">Lightweight yet strong structure<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1452\">\n<p data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1452\">Suitable for pendant lights, table lamps, or floor lamps<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1453\" data-end=\"1531\">\n<p data-start=\"1455\" data-end=\"1531\">Available in multiple shapes and sizes (customizable for wholesale orders)<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1590\">\n<p data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1590\">Perfect for hotels, restaurants, cafes, and home d\u00e9cor<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1755\">","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" \u20ab"},"price_html":"","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":1106,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/VH24058-wicker-lampshade-from-Vietnam.jpg?fit=510%2C600&ssl=1","thumbnail":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/VH24058-wicker-lampshade-from-Vietnam.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1","srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/VH24058-wicker-lampshade-from-Vietnam.jpg?w=510&ssl=1 510w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/VH24058-wicker-lampshade-from-Vietnam.jpg?resize=340%2C400&ssl=1 340w","sizes":"(max-width: 510px) 100vw, 510px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/VH24058-wicker-lampshade-from-Vietnam.jpg?resize=280%2C280&ssl=1 280w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/VH24058-wicker-lampshade-from-Vietnam.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/VH24058-wicker-lampshade-from-Vietnam.jpg?resize=100%2C100&ssl=1 100w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px","name":"VH24058-wicker-lampshade-from-Vietnam","alt":""}],"categories":[{"id":170,"name":"Home &amp; Decor","slug":"home-decor","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-category\/product-type\/home-decor\/"},{"id":202,"name":"Home Living","slug":"