ata-start=\"202\" data-end=\"205\" \/>Our <strong data-start=\"209\" data-end=\"257\">rattan storage basket in elegant black color<\/strong> is handwoven by skilled Vietnamese artisans using sustainably sourced natural rattan. The classic design combines durability with modern aesthetics, making it a perfect choice for home storage and interior decoration. Each basket is tightly woven to ensure sturdiness and longevity, while the black finish adds a contemporary touch suitable for any space \u2014 from living rooms and bedrooms to offices and retail displays.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"1003\">This eco-friendly storage basket is lightweight yet strong, offering a practical and stylish way to organize toys, books, clothes, or household essentials. By choosing handcrafted baskets from Vietnam, you also contribute to preserving traditional craftsmanship and creating stable income for local farmers and artisans.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1023\"><strong data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1021\">Key Features<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1348\">\n<li data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1080\">\n<p data-start=\"1026\" data-end=\"1080\">Material: 100% natural rattan, sustainably harvested<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1110\">\n<p data-start=\"1083\" data-end=\"1110\">Color: Matte black finish<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1172\">\n<p data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1172\">Shape: Available in round, square, or rectangular designs<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1209\">\n<p data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1209\">Handwoven by Vietnamese artisans<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1277\">\n<p data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1277\">Durable, eco-friendly, and versatile for home or office storage<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1348\">\n<p data-start=\"1280\" data-end=\"1348\">Wholesale &amp; bulk supply available directly from factory in Vietnam<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1866\" data-end=\"2006\">\n<p data-start=\"2013\" data-end=\"2272\">\ud83d\udc49 Supplier &amp; Manufacturer in Vietnam:<br data-start=\"2051\" data-end=\"2054\" \/>We provide <strong data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2104\">high-quality rattan storage baskets<\/strong> in bulk and wholesale quantities for retailers, importers, and decorators. For inquiries, please contact us at <strong data-start=\"2216\" data-end=\"2243\"><a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"2218\" data-end=\"2241\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com<\/a><\/strong> | WhatsApp: +84-975810168.<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" \u20ab"},"price_html":"","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":1101,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/VH24059-rattan-storage-basket-black.jpg?fit=510%2C600&ssl=1","thumbnail":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/VH24059-rattan-storage-basket-black.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1","srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/VH24059-rattan-storage-basket-black.jpg?w=510&ssl=1 510w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/VH24059-rattan-storage-basket-black.jpg?resize=340%2C400&ssl=1 340w","sizes":"(max-width: 510px) 100vw, 510px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/VH24059-rattan-storage-basket-black.jpg?resize=280%2C280&ssl=1 280w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/VH24059-rattan-storage-basket-black.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/VH24059-rattan-storage-basket-black.jpg?resize=100%2C100&ssl=1 100w","thumbnail_