 modern functionality, making it both a decorative and practical piece.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"528\" data-end=\"859\">Each tray is made by skilled artisans who carefully inlay seashell pieces into the wooden base, creating a shimmering mosaic effect that reflects light beautifully. This makes the tray not only ideal for <strong data-start=\"732\" data-end=\"766\">serving drinks, tea, or snacks<\/strong>, but also as a <strong data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"856\">centerpiece for dining tables, coffee tables, or luxury d\u00e9cor displays<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"861\" data-end=\"1198\">Vietnam is renowned for its long tradition of shell inlay art. By choosing this product, you are supporting local artisans, helping preserve cultural heritage, and promoting eco-friendly handmade crafts. Almost 100% of materials and labor are sourced locally, contributing to rural livelihoods and generating export income for Vietnam.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1288\">For bulk orders or wholesale supply, please contact us at <strong data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1285\"><a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1260\" data-end=\"1283\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com<\/a><\/strong>.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1293\" \/>\n<h3 data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1314\">Key Features:<\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1621\">\n<li data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1392\">\n<p data-start=\"1317\" data-end=\"1392\">Material: Natural <strong data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1366\">Mother of Pearl (MOP) inlay<\/strong> on a sturdy wooden base<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1435\">\n<p data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1435\">Shape: Round design with smooth finish<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1436\" data-end=\"1479\">\n<p data-start=\"1438\" data-end=\"1479\">Handmade by skilled Vietnamese artisans<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1519\">\n<p data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1519\">Durable, elegant, and easy to clean<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1573\">\n<p data-start=\"1522\" data-end=\"1573\">Ideal for serving or as a decorative luxury piece<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1621\">\n<p data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1621\">Wholesale &amp; bulk orders available worldwide<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" \u20ab"},"price_html":"","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":1075,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/VH24069-MOP-round-tray-Vietnam.jpg?fit=510%2C600&ssl=1","thumbnail":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/VH24069-MOP-round-tray-Vietnam.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1","srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/VH24069-MOP-round-tray-Vietnam.jpg?w=510&ssl=1 510w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/VH24069-MOP-round-tray-Vietnam.jpg?resize=340%2C400&ssl=1 340w","sizes":"(max-width: 510px) 100vw, 510px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/VH24069-MOP-round-tray-Vietnam.jpg?resize=280%2C280&ssl=1 280w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/VH24069-MOP-round-tray-Vietnam.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/VH24069-MOP-round-tray-Vietnam.jpg?resize=100%2C100&ssl=1 100w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px","name":"VH24069-MOP-round-tray-Vietnam","alt":""},{"id":1073,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/VH24069-MOP-round-tray-set-from-Vietnam.jpg?fit=1080%2C1080&ssl=1","thumbnail":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/VH24069