\"1002\">By producing and exporting these handcrafted products, we not only bring the cultural heritage of Vietnam to global markets but also create sustainable jobs for local artisans, supporting rural communities and preserving traditional craftsmanship.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1226\"><strong data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1224\">Key Features<\/strong><\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1465\">\n<li data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1274\">\n<p data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1274\">Material: Natural <strong data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1272\">mother of pearl shell<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1321\">\n<p data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1321\">Finish: Polished surface, shiny and smooth<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1371\">\n<p data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1371\">Rim &amp; Stand: Solid brass, corrosion-resistant<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1372\" data-end=\"1407\">\n<p data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1407\">Handmade by Vietnamese artisans<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1465\">\n<p data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1465\">Uses: Serving dish, jewelry tray, d\u00e9cor item, or gift<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1836\" data-end=\"1839\" \/>\n<p data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"2113\">\ud83d\udc49 <strong data-start=\"1844\" data-end=\"1882\">Supplier &amp; Manufacturer in Vietnam<\/strong><br data-start=\"1882\" data-end=\"1885\" \/>We provide high-quality, naturally sourced seashell products with bulk and wholesale options for retailers, decorators, and artisans.<br data-start=\"2018\" data-end=\"2021\" \/>For inquiries, please contact us: <strong data-start=\"2055\" data-end=\"2111\"><a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"2057\" data-end=\"2082\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com<\/a> | WhatsApp +84-369-808-668<\/strong><\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currenc