teriors, or home decoration. It is eco-friendly, fully biodegradable, and customizable for wholesale orders.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"762\"><strong data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"760\">Key Features:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"1084\">\n<li data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"813\">\n<p data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"813\"><strong data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"778\">Material:<\/strong> 100% natural rattan from Vietnam<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"870\">\n<p data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"870\"><strong data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"834\">Craftsmanship:<\/strong> Handwoven by experienced artisans<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"939\">\n<p data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"939\"><strong data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"884\">Design:<\/strong> Artistic branch-and-leaf motif with a natural finish<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"1001\">\n<p data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"1001\"><strong data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"959\">Eco-Friendly:<\/strong> Sustainable and biodegradable materials<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1084\">\n<p data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1084\"><strong data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1022\">Custom Orders:<\/strong> Size, design, and finish can be tailored for bulk purchases<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1447\"><strong data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1116\">Cultural &amp; Economic Value:<\/strong><br data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1119\" \/>By choosing our <strong data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1174\">Vietnamese rattan branch-leaf decor<\/strong>, you are supporting local craft villages, creating income for rural farmers during non-harvest seasons, and preserving cultural heritage in weaving. Vietnam\u2019s handicraft exports contribute significantly to the economy, using nearly 100% domestic raw materials and labor.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1471\"><strong data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1469\">Why Buy from Us:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1713\">\n<li data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1521\">\n<p data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"1521\">Direct <strong data-start=\"1481\" data-end=\"1508\">manufacturer &amp; exporter<\/strong> in Vietnam<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1522\" data-end=\"1601\">\n<p data-start=\"1524\" data-end=\"1601\">Over 15 years of experience supplying to Europe, America, and other markets<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1602\" data-end=\"1667\">\n<p data-start=\"1604\" data-end=\"1667\"><strong data-start=\"1604\" data-end=\"1624\">Wholesale orders<\/strong> starting from one container per shipment<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1668\" data-end=\"1713\">\n<p data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"1713\">International shipping &amp; secure packaging<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" \u20ab"},"price_html":"","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":1027,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/VH24076-rattan-leaf-decor-made-in-Vietnam.jpg?fit=510%2C600&ssl=1","thumbnail":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/VH24076-rattan-leaf-decor-made-in-Vietnam.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1","srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/VH24076-rattan-leaf-decor-made-in-Vietnam.jpg?w=510&ssl=1 510w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/VH24076-rattan-leaf-decor-made-in-Vietnam.jpg?resize=340%2C400&ssl=1 340w","sizes":"(max-width: 510px) 100vw, 510px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/VH24076-rattan-leaf-decor-made-in-Vietnam.jpg?resize=280%2C280&ssl=1 280w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/VH24076-rattan-leaf-