ut &ldquo;Vietnam Woven Rattan Basket \u2013 Handmade &#038; Sustainable&rdquo;","url":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product\/vietnam-woven-rattan-basket-handmade-sustainable\/","single_text":"Add to cart","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/1000","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=1000&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":989,"name":"Rubber Wooden Spoon \u2013 Handmade in Vietnam","slug":"rubber-wooden-spoon-handmade-in-vietnam","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product\/rubber-wooden-spoon-handmade-in-vietnam\/","sku":"VH24078","short_description":"<p>Eco-friendly <strong data-start=\"1680\" data-end=\"1703\">rubber wooden spoon<\/strong> handmade in Vietnam, ideal for homes, hotels, and restaurants.<\/p>","description":"<h2 data-start=\"117\" data-end=\"167\"><strong data-start=\"120\" data-end=\"165\">Rubber Wooden Spoon \u2013 Handmade in Vietnam<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"169\" data-end=\"751\"><strong data-start=\"169\" data-end=\"192\">Product Description<\/strong><br data-start=\"192\" data-end=\"195\" \/>Experience the warmth of natural dining with our <strong data-start=\"244\" data-end=\"267\">Rubber Wooden Spoon<\/strong>, handcrafted by skilled Vietnamese artisans. Made from sustainable rubber wood, this spoon is lightweight, durable, and naturally food-safe, making it perfect for everyday meals or special occasions. Rubber wood is known for its smooth texture and rich natural grain, ensuring each spoon is unique. Produced in Vietnam\u2019s traditional woodworking villages, this product not only supports local communities but also promotes eco-friendly living through the use of renewable resources.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"771\"><strong data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"769\">Key Features<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"1102\">\n<li data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"821\">\n<p data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"821\">100% natural, sustainably sourced rubber wood<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"865\">\n<p data-start=\"824\" data-end=\"865\">Handmade by skilled artisans in Vietnam<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"866\" data-end=\"915\">\n<p data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"915\">Lightweight, durable, and comfortable to hold<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"953\">\n<p data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"953\">Food-safe and eco-friendly finish<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"1009\">\n<p data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"1009\">Unique wood grain \u2013 no two spoons are exactly alike<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1057\">\n<p data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1057\">OEM\/ODM &amp; wholesale manufacturing available<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1102\">\n<p data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1102\">Ideal for homes, restaurants, and hotels<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1392\"><strong data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1129\">Contact for Wholesale<\/strong><br data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1132\" \/>We are a trusted <strong data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1222\">rubber wooden spoon manufacturer, supplier, and exporter from Vietnam<\/strong>, offering bulk and custom orders worldwide.<br data-start=\"1266\" data-end=\"1269\" \/>\ud83d\udce7 Email: <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1302\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com<\/a><br data-start=\"1302\" data-end=\"1305\" \/>\ud83d\udcf1 WhatsApp: +84-975810168<br data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1334\" \/>\ud83c\udf10 Website: <a class=\"\" href=\"https:\/\/www.vietcraft.vn\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1390\">www.vietcraft.vn<\/a><\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":