-pearl-mop-handcrafted-in-vietnam\/","sku":"VH25033","short_description":"<p>Oval placemat made of rattan and MOP, handcrafted in Vietnam. Stylish, natural, and ideal for premium table d\u00e9cor.<\/p>","description":"<p data-start=\"147\" data-end=\"715\"><strong data-start=\"147\" data-end=\"170\">Product Description<\/strong><br data-start=\"170\" data-end=\"173\" \/>Elevate your table setting with our <strong data-start=\"209\" data-end=\"253\">Oval Rattan and Mother of Pearl Placemat<\/strong>, handcrafted by skilled Vietnamese artisans. This elegant piece blends natural rattan weaving with the delicate beauty of mother-of-pearl inlay, making it a standout for coastal, boho, or luxury dining aesthetics. Lightweight yet durable, each placemat is eco-friendly, sustainable, and perfect for both everyday use and special occasions. Crafted in Vietnam\u2019s traditional craft villages, this product showcases cultural heritage and supports local communities.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"735\"><strong data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"733\">Key Features<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"736\" data-end=\"1073\">\n<li data-start=\"736\" data-end=\"781\">\n<p data-start=\"738\" data-end=\"781\">Handwoven from sustainable natural rattan<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"836\">\n<p data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"836\">Decorated with genuine mother-of-pearl (MOP) inlay<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"883\">\n<p data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"883\">Oval shape adds a unique and refined touch<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"935\">\n<p data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"935\">Durable, heat-resistant, and easy to wipe clean<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"980\">\n<p data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"980\">Ideal for homes, restaurants, and hotels<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"981\" data-end=\"1027\">\n<p data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1027\">OEM\/ODM production and wholesale available<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1073\">\n<p data-start=\"1030\" data-end=\"1073\">Handmade in Vietnam using ethical practices<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1490\"><strong data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1248\">Contact for Wholesale<\/strong><br data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1251\" \/>We are a trusted <strong data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1319\">placemat manufacturer and exporter from Vietnam<\/strong>, ready to support your bulk and custom orders.<br data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1369\" \/>\ud83d\udce7 Email: <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1402\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com<\/a><br data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1405\" \/>\ud83d\udcf1 WhatsApp: +84-975810168<br data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1434\" \/>\ud83c\udf10 Website: <a class=\"\" href=\"https:\/\/www.vietcraft.vn\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1490\">www.vietcraft.vn<\/a><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1492\" data-end=\"1714\"><strong data-start=\"1492\" data-end=\"1510\">Focus Keywords<\/strong><br data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1513\" \/>oval placemat Vietnam, rattan MOP placemat, handmade table mat, natural rattan decor, mother of pearl placemat, placemat manufacturer Vietnam, wholesale rattan placemat, eco-friendly tableware supplier<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" \u20ab"},"price_html":"","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":978,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/VH25033-oval-placemat-from-rattan-seashell.jpg?fit=510%2C600&ssl=1","thumbnail":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/VH25033-oval-placemat-from-rattan-seashell.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1","srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/upl