s and labor.<\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"773\" data-end=\"791\"><strong data-start=\"773\" data-end=\"789\">Key Features<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"792\" data-end=\"1084\">\n<li data-start=\"792\" data-end=\"861\">\n<p data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"861\">Handcrafted from natural wood (acacia, rubberwood, or mango wood)<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"862\" data-end=\"912\">\n<p data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"912\">Food-safe finish, ideal for dry or fresh foods<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"955\">\n<p data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"955\">Smooth surface with rich natural grain<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"990\">\n<p data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"990\">Eco-friendly and biodegradable<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1033\">\n<p data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1033\">Available in multiple sizes and shapes<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1084\">\n<p data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1084\">OEM &amp; ODM service available for wholesale buyers<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1461\"><strong data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1267\">Contact for Wholesale<\/strong><br data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1270\" \/>Looking for a reliable <strong data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1345\">wooden bowl manufacturer and supplier in Vietnam<\/strong>?<br data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1349\" \/>\ud83d\udce7 Email: <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1382\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com<\/a><br data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1385\" \/>\ud83d\udcf1 WhatsApp: +84-975810168<br data-start=\"1411\" data-end=\"1414\" \/>\ud83c\udf10 <a class=\"\" href=\"https:\/\/www.vietcraft.vn\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1461\">www.vietcraft.vn<\/a><\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","c