ustainable and eco-friendly materials<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"1002\">\n<p data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"1002\">Perfect for hospitality, retail, and home design<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1040\">\n<p data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1040\">OEM &amp; ODM manufacturing supported<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1088\">\n<p data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1088\">Compliant with international export standards<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1487\"><strong data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1278\">Contact for Wholesale<\/strong><br data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1281\" \/>Partner with a trusted <strong data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1362\">bamboo lighting manufacturer and exporter from Vietnam<\/strong>.<br data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1366\" \/>\ud83d\udce7 Email: <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1376\" data-end=\"1399\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com<\/a><br data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1402\" \/>\ud83d\udcf1 WhatsApp: +84-975810168<br data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1431\" \/>\ud83c\udf10 Website: <a class=\"\" href=\"https:\/\/www.vietcraft.vn\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1487\">www.vietcraft.vn<\/a><\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" \u20ab"},"price_html":"","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":954,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/VH24080-bamboo-pendant-light-manufacturer-in-Vietnam.jpg?fit=510%2C600&ssl=1","thumbnail":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/VH24080-bamboo-pendant-light-manufacturer-in-Vietnam.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1","srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/0