orts. Whether you&#8217;re a decorator, importer, or shell collector, this item offers timeless beauty and authentic craftsmanship.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"641\"><strong data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"639\">Key Features<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"996\">\n<li data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"686\">\n<p data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"686\">Sourced sustainably from coastal Vietnam<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"741\">\n<p data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"741\">Natural jade-green tone with pearl-polished finish<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"782\">\n<p data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"782\">Available in various sizes (6\u201312 cm)<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"852\">\n<p data-start=\"785\" data-end=\"852\">Suitable for home decor, spa accessories, giftware, and aquariums<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"901\">\n<p data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"901\">Hand-finished for superior shine and quality<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"953\">\n<p data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"953\">Bulk and wholesale orders welcome (MOQ applies)<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"996\">\n<p data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"996\">Export-ready with eco-friendly packaging<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1411\"><strong data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1182\">Contact for Wholesale<\/strong><br data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1185\" \/>Looking for a <strong data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1231\">Vietnamese seashell supplier<\/strong> or factory that offers <strong data-start=\"1255\" data-end=\"1281\">bulk jade turbo shells<\/strong>?<br data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1285\" \/>\ud83d\udce7 Email: <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1320\">seashellcraftvn@gmail.com<\/a><br data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1323\" \/>\ud83d\udcf1 WhatsApp: +84-369-808-668<br data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1354\" \/>\ud83c\udf10 <a class=\"cursor-