stry<\/strong>. The natural shine of the mother of pearl adds sophistication, making it perfect for upscale homes, restaurants, hotels, or gift purposes.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"857\" \/>\n<h3 data-start=\"859\" data-end=\"884\">\u2705 <strong data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"882\">Key Features:<\/strong><\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"885\" data-end=\"1138\">\n<li data-start=\"885\" data-end=\"928\">\n<p data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"928\">Material: Genuine Mother of Pearl inlay<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"945\">\n<p data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"945\">Shape: Round<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"982\">\n<p data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"982\">Finish: Smooth, polished surface<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1031\">\n<p data-start=\"985\" data-end=\"1031\">Handmade by experienced craftsmen in Vietnam<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1087\">\n<p data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1087\">Multi-functional: for serving or as decorative tray<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1138\">\n<p data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1138\">Custom sizes and patterns available upon request<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1140\" data-end=\"1143\" \/>\n<h3 data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1192\">\ud83c\udf3f <strong data-start=\"1152\" data-end=\"1190\">Why Choose Vietnamese Handicrafts?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1525\">Our handmade products utilize <strong data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1267\">100% locally sourced materials and labor<\/strong>, supporting Vietnam\u2019s traditional craft villages. Exporting these artisan items helps generate <strong data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1397\">foreign income for the country<\/strong>, create <strong data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1451\">extra jobs for farmers during off-seasons<\/strong>, and <strong data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1487\">preserve cultural heritage<\/strong> through generations of craftsmanship.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"