tart=\"1027\" data-end=\"1278\">\n<li data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1068\">\n<p data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1068\">Material: 100% natural water hyacinth<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1113\">\n<p data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1113\">Color: Black dyed with durable finishing<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1167\">\n<p data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1167\">Design: Fabric-trimmed edge and full inner lining<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1225\">\n<p data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1225\">Usage: Handbag, shopping bag, beach bag, fashion tote<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1278\">\n<p data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1278\">Eco-friendly and sustainably handmade in Vietnam<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1280\" data-end=\"1283\" \/>\n<h3 data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1331\">\ud83c\udf3f <strong data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1329\">Why Choose Vietnamese Handicrafts<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1672\">This product represents <strong data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1389\">Vietnam\u2019s rich craft heritage<\/strong> \u2014 handmade from <strong data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1436\">domestic natural materials<\/strong> and woven by local artisans. The handicraft industry provides <strong data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1534\">employment to rural communities<\/strong>, especially farmers during off-season, while generating <strong data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1609\">foreign income<\/strong> and preserving <strong data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"1644\">cultural values<\/strong> through traditional skills.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1677\" \/>\n<h3 data-start=\"1679\" data-end=\"1721\">\ud83d\udce6 <strong data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1719\">Contact for Wholesale Orders:<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1722\" data-end=\"1861\">\ud83d\udce7 <strong data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1735\">Email:<\/strong> <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1736