e the outer rattan frame is meticulously woven by skilled artisans for added durability and charm.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"822\">Perfect for serving fruits, bread, or snacks, or simply as a <strong data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"651\">decorative centerpiece<\/strong>. This product blends <strong data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"706\">functionality, sustainability<\/strong>, and <strong data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"732\">aesthetic appeal<\/strong>, making it ideal for eco-conscious homeware collections, restaurants, or hotel tableware.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"824\" data-end=\"980\">Produced by <strong data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"867\">Vietnam Handicraft Co., Ltd<\/strong>, a reputable <strong data-start=\"881\" data-end=\"926\">factory and wholesale supplier in Vietnam<\/strong>, this bowl is available for bulk purchase and export.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"985\" \/>\n<h3 data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"1012\">\u2705 <strong data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1010\">Key Features:<\/strong><\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1279\">\n<li data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1074\">\n<p data-start=\"1015\" data-end=\"1074\">Materials: High-fired ceramic with natural rattan weaving<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1113\">\n<p data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1113\">Dimensions: Custom sizes available<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1160\">\n<p data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1160\">Handcrafted by skilled artisans in Vietnam<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1161\" data-end=\"1222\">\n<p data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1222\">Use: Food-safe serving bowl, decorative table centerpiece<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1279\">\n<p data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1279\">Design: Unique fish motif with rustic woven contrast<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1284\" \/>\n<h3 data-start=\"1286\" data-end=\"1334\">\ud83c\udf3f <strong data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1332\">The Value of Vietnamese Handicrafts<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1681\">Each bowl represents the heart of Vietnam\u2019s rural economy \u2014 using <strong data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1448\">100% domestic raw materials and local labor<\/strong>. The production not only <strong data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"1502\">creates jobs for farmers<\/strong> during off-seasons but also contributes to <strong data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1573\">foreign currency income<\/strong> for the country. Every handcrafted product helps preserve cultural identity and promote sustainable living.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1686\" \/>\n<h3 data-start=\"1688\" data-end=\"1730\">\ud83d\udce6 <strong data-start=\"1695\" data-end=\"1728\">Contact for Wholesale Orders:<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1870\">\ud83d\udce7 <strong data-start=\"1734\" data-end=\"1744\">Email:<\/strong> <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1745\" data-end=\"1768\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com<\/a><br data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1771\" \/>\ud83d\udcf1 <strong data-start=\"1774\" data-end=\"1793\">Phone\/WhatsApp:<\/strong> +84-975810168<br data-start=\"1807\" data-end=\"1810\" \/>\ud83c\udf10 <strong data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1825\">Website:<\/strong> <a class=\"\" href=\"https:\/\/www.vietcraft.vn\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1826\" data-end=\"1870\">www.vietcraft.vn<\/a><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1917\" data-end=\"2087\">","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" \u20ab"},"price_html":"","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":870,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/VH24065-ceramic-rattan-bowl.jpg?fit=510%2C600&ssl=1","thumbnail":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/w