inish and wooden legs. Lightweight, eco-friendly, and perfect for modern rustic interiors.<\/p>","description":"<p data-start=\"247\" data-end=\"572\">Elevate your living space with this <strong data-start=\"283\" data-end=\"312\">elegant spun bamboo table<\/strong>, meticulously handcrafted by skilled Vietnamese artisans. Made entirely from natural bamboo strips coiled and pressed into a smooth circular tabletop, this minimalist table showcases the beauty of Vietnam\u2019s traditional craftsmanship and sustainable materials.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"574\" data-end=\"875\">Perfect as a coffee table, side table, or accent piece in eco-conscious homes, boutique hotels, or display areas, it combines lightweight structure with remarkable durability. Its smooth, natural finish highlights the subtle texture of bamboo rings, bringing warmth and organic charm to your interior.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"1054\">At <strong data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"911\">Vietnam Handicraft Co., Ltd<\/strong>, we are a leading <strong data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"969\">manufacturer and wholesale supplier<\/strong> of bamboo furniture, offering custom sizes and bulk orders for international buyers.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"1054\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-858\" src=\"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/VH24088-round-dining-table-made-of-spun-bamboo-in-Vietnam-400x400.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\" \/><\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1059\" \/>\n<h3 data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1086\">\u2705 <strong data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1084\">Key Features:<\/strong><\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1377\">\n<li data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1134\">\n<p data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1134\">Material: 100% Spun Bamboo with Wooden Legs<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1189\">\n<p data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1189\">Style: Minimalist, round shape, modern rustic look<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1232\">\n<p data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1232\">Size: Customizable diameter and height<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1287\">\n<p data-start=\"1235\" data-end=\"1287\">Usage: Coffee table, side table, living room d\u00e9cor<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1338\">\n<p data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1338\">Finish: Natural matte, polished bamboo surface<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1339\" data-end=\"1377\">\n<p data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1377\">Lightweight yet sturdy and durable<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1382\" \/>\n<h3 data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1433\">\ud83c\udf3f <strong data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1431\">The Meaning of Vietnamese Handicraft<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1872\">Choosing this spun bamboo table not only supports a <strong data-start=\"1486\" data-end=\"1511\">sustainable lifestyle<\/strong> but also helps promote Vietnam&#8217;s cultural heritage. These tables are crafted using nearly 100% <strong data-start=\"1607\" data-end=\"1636\">locally sourced materials<\/strong> and <strong data-start=\"1641\" data-end=\"1661\">Vietnamese labor<\/strong>, generating <strong data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1692\">foreign income<\/strong> for the country and creating jobs for rural farmers during non-harvest seasons. This timeless craft preserves cultural traditions while supporting ethical manufacturing practices.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1874\" data-end=\"1877\" \/>\n<h3 data-start=\"1879\" data-end=\"1921\">\ud83d\udce6 <strong data-start=\"1886\" data-end=\"1919\">Contact for Wholesale Orders:<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"2061\">\ud83d\udce7 <strong data-start=\"1925\" data-end=\"1935\">Email:<\/strong> <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"1959\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com<\/a><br data-start=\"1959\" data-end=\"1962\" \/>\ud83d\udcf1 <strong data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"1984\">Phone\/WhatsApp:<\/strong> +84-975810168<br data-start=\"1998\" data-end=\"2001\" \/>\ud83c\udf10 <strong data-start=\"2004\" data-end=\"2016\">Website:<\/strong> <a class=\"\" href=\"https:\/\/www.vietcraft.vn\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"2017\" data-end=\"2061\">www.vietcraft.vn<\/a><\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" \u20ab"},"price_html":"","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":856,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/VH24088-spun-bamboo-table-made-in-Vietnam.jpg?fit=510%2C600&ssl=1","thumbnail":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/VH24088-spun-bamboo-table-made-in-Vietnam.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1","srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/VH24088-spun-bamboo-table-made-in-Vietnam.jpg?w=510&ssl=1 510w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/VH24088-spun-bamboo-table-made-in-Vietnam.jpg?resize=340%2C400&ssl=1 340w","sizes":"(max-width: 510px) 100vw, 510px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/VH24088-spun-bamboo-table-made-in-Vietnam.jpg?resize=280%2C280&ssl=1 280w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/VH24088-spun-bamboo-table-made-in-Vietnam.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/VH24088-spun-bamboo-table-made-in-Vietnam.jpg?resize=100%2C100&ssl=1 100w","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px","name":"VH24088-spun-bamboo-table-made-in-Vietnam","alt":""}],"categories":[{"id":71,"name":"Bamboo","slug":"bamboo","link":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product-category\/materials\/bamboo\/"},{"id":204,"name":