able-from-vietnam-manufacturer\/","single_text":"Add to cart","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/852","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=852&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":847,"name":"Bamboo Wall Lamp from Vietnam","slug":"bamboo-wall-lamp-from-vietnam","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product\/bamboo-wall-lamp-from-vietnam\/","sku":"","short_description":"<p>Handwoven bamboo wall lamp from Vietnam. Lightweight, natural design for soft ambient lighting. Custom and wholesale available.<\/p>","description":"<p data-start=\"247\" data-end=\"566\">Bring a warm, ambient glow to your living space with this <strong data-start=\"305\" data-end=\"335\">handwoven bamboo wall lamp<\/strong>, a unique fusion of nature and craftsmanship. Made by skilled artisans in Vietnam using 100% sustainably harvested bamboo, this wall lamp adds charm and character to any room\u2014whether it&#8217;s a cozy home, eco-resort, or boutique caf\u00e9.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"856\">Its cylindrical shape, open weave pattern, and natural finish allow soft light to filter through beautifully, creating a calming atmosphere. The lamp is lightweight, durable, and easy to install on any wall, perfect for those seeking a rustic, handmade, and sustainable lighting solution.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"982\">As a <strong data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"913\">manufacturer and wholesale supplier in Vietnam<\/strong>, we offer custom sizing, colors, and bulk pricing for global buyers.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"987\" \/>\n<h3 data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1014\">\u2705 <strong data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1012\">Key Features:<\/strong><\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1015\" data-end=\"1235\">\n<li data-start=\"1015\" data-end=\"1048\">\n<p data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1048\">Material: 100% Natural Bamboo<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1093\">\n<p data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1093\">Style: Open weave, cylindrical, handmade<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1149\">\n<p data-start=\"1096\" data-end=\"1149\">Use: Indoor wall lamp for bedrooms, hallways, cafes<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1188\">\n<p data-start=\"1152\" data-end=\"1188\">Finish: Natural tone, customizable<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1235\">\n<p data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1235\">Easy installation, lightweight and durable<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1240\" \/>\n<h3 data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1290\">\ud83c\udf3f <strong data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1288\">The Value of Vietnamese Handicrafts<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1291\" data-end=\"1661\">This handcrafted bamboo wall lamp not only enhances your space with organic aesthetics but also represents a deeper value. Nearly 100% of materials and labor used are sourced within Vietnam, helping generate foreign exchange revenue for the country. It creates jobs for rural farmers during off-season periods and sustains traditional crafts passed down for generations.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1663\" data-end=\"1666\" \/>\n<h3 data-start=\"1668\" data-end=\"1710\">\ud83d\udce6 <strong data-start=\"1675\" data-end=\"1708\">Contact for Wholesale Orders:<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"1850\">\ud83d\udce7 <strong data-start=\"1714\" data-end=\"1724\">Email:<\/strong> <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1748\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com<\/a><br data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1751\" \/>\ud83d\udcf1 <strong data-start=\"1754\" data-end=\"1773\">Phone\/WhatsApp:<\/strong> +84-975810168<br data-start=\"1787\" data-end=\"179