handwoven rattan<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1113\">\n<p data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1113\">Multi-functional: placemat or wall hanging<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1157\">\n<p data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1157\">Lightweight, durable, and eco-conscious<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1212\">\n<p data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1212\">Elegant interlaced pattern for modern rustic decor<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1247\">\n<p data-start=\"1215\" data-end=\"1247\">OEM, ODM &amp; bulk export available<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1252\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1254\" data-end=\"1292\">\ud83c\udf0d <strong data-start=\"1260\" data-end=\"1290\">Cultural &amp; Economic Value:<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1576\">Every purchase supports Vietnam\u2019s rural communities and promotes the country\u2019s cultural heritage. These products are crafted from local materials by local hands \u2014 helping generate foreign income and offering off-season employment for farmers, all while preserving traditional crafts.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1581\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1617\">\u2709\ufe0f <strong data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1615\">Contact for Wholesale:<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1757\">\ud83d\udce7 Email: <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1651\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com<\/a><br data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1654\" \/>\ud83c\udf10 Website: <a class=\"\" href=\"https:\/\/www.vietcraft.vn\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1666\" data-end=\"1710\">www.vietcraft.vn<\/a><br data-start=\"1710\" data-end=\"1713\" \/>\ud83d\udce6 Custom and bulk orders welcomed worldwide<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_