sket from Vietnam","slug":"oval-woven-rattan-basket-handmade-natural-storage-basket-from-vietnam","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product\/oval-woven-rattan-basket-handmade-natural-storage-basket-from-vietnam\/","sku":"VH24094","short_description":"<p>Beautiful handwoven rattan basket in oval shape, perfect for serving or storing. Handmade in Vietnam with sustainable materials.<\/p>","description":"<p data-start=\"198\" data-end=\"555\">This <strong data-start=\"203\" data-end=\"238\">oval-shaped woven rattan basket<\/strong> is meticulously handcrafted by artisans in Vietnam, showcasing the country\u2019s deep-rooted tradition in natural fiber weaving. Designed with a unique open-pattern side and a tight weave base, this basket offers both ventilation and structure, making it ideal for storing bread, fruits, toiletries, or decorative items.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"557\" data-end=\"803\">Made from sustainably harvested rattan, the basket reflects an eco-conscious lifestyle and adds a warm, rustic charm to kitchens, caf\u00e9s, and hotel rooms. Its lightweight yet durable design ensures long-term use while remaining visually appealing.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"997\">Vietnam Handicraft Co., Ltd is a trusted <strong data-start=\"846\" data-end=\"905\">wholesale rattan basket supplier and factory in Vietnam<\/strong>, providing customized designs, bulk supply, and OEM\/ODM solutions for international buyers.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"999\" data-end=\"1002\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1028\">\u2705 <strong data-start=\"1009\" data-end=\"1026\">Key Features:<\/strong><\/h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1249\">\n<li data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1067\">\n<p data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1067\">Handwoven from 100% natural rattan<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1113\">\n<p data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1113\">Oval shape with elegant decorative border<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1157\">\n<p data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1157\">Lightweight, durable, and biodegradable<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1208\">\n<p data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1208\">Ideal for storage, display, or hospitality use<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1249\">\n<p data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1249\">OEM, custom sizes &amp; branding available<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1254\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1291\">\ud83c\udf3f <strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1289\">Craft &amp; Cultural Value:<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1569\">Our rattan baskets are made using domestic materials and local labor, supporting Vietnamese rural communities with off-season employment. Handicraft production brings foreign revenue to the country, utilizes nearly 100% local resources, and preserves traditional craftsmanship.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1571\" data-end=\"1574\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1610\">\u2709\ufe0f <strong data-start=\"1582\" data-end=\"1608\">Contact for Wholesale:<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1753\">\ud83d\udce7 Email: <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1644\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com<\/a><br data-start=\"1644\" data-end=\"1647\" \/>\ud83c\udf10 Website: <a class=\"\" href=\"https:\/\/www.vietcraft.vn\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1659\" data-end=\"1703\">www.vietcraft.vn<\/a><br data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1706\" \/>\ud83d\udce6 Large orders &amp; private label options welcome<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" \u20ab"},"price_html":"","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":813,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.