e-modern-natural-lighting-from-vietnam","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product\/black-rattan-lampshade-modern-natural-lighting-from-vietnam\/","sku":"VH24095","short_description":"<p>Modern handwoven lampshade made from black rattan. Handmade in Vietnam. Ideal for cafes, homes, and hotels. Wholesale &amp; OEM available.<\/p>","description":"<p data-start=\"323\" data-end=\"554\">This <strong data-start=\"328\" data-end=\"364\">black rattan lampshade<\/strong> blends traditional craftsmanship with a bold, modern design. Crafted by skilled artisans in Vietnam using sustainably sourced rattan, this piece delivers both style and eco-conscious value.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"556\" data-end=\"850\">The open-weave pattern allows ambient light to filter through beautifully, making it perfect for creating a cozy atmosphere in living rooms, caf\u00e9s, restaurants, or hotels. Its elegant cone shape and black finish offer a stunning contrast that complements both rustic and contemporary interiors.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"1067\">Vietnam Handicraft Co., Ltd, a leading <strong data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"947\">rattan lighting manufacturer and supplier in Vietnam<\/strong>, offers this item with bulk pricing and private label options for global wholesalers and interior design professionals.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1072\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1098\">\u2705 <strong data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1096\">Key Features:<\/strong><\/h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1412\">\n<li data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1155\">\n<p data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1155\">Handwoven from natural rattan by Vietnamese artisans<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1208\">\n<p data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1208\">Black color finish for a bold, contemporary look<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1246\">\n<p data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1246\">Lightweight yet durable structure<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1297\">\n<p data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1297\">Compatible with various pendant light fittings<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1298\" data-end=\"1355\">\n<p data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1355\">Custom sizing and finishes available for large orders<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1412\">\n<p data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1412\">Perfect for home d\u00e9cor, hospitality, or commercial use<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1417\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1447\">\ud83c\udf3f <strong data-start=\"1425\" data-end=\"1445\">Craft &amp; Culture:<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1722\">Our rattan lampshades are made using <strong data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1528\">100% domestic materials and local labor<\/strong>, helping generate foreign income and creating jobs for rural workers in their downtime. This helps preserve Vietnam\u2019s traditional handcrafting heritage while supporting sustainable livelihoods.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1727\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1729\" data-end=\"1763\">\u2709\ufe0f <strong data-start=\"1735\" data-end=\"1761\">Contact for Wholesale:<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1894\">\ud83d\udce7 Email: <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1774\" data-end=\"1797\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com<\/a><br data-start=\"1797\" data-end=\"1800\" \/>\ud83c\udf10 Website: <a class=\"\" href=\"https:\/\/www.vietcraft.vn\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1856\">www.vietcraft.vn<\/a><br data-start=\"1856\" data-end=\"1859\" \/>\ud83d\udce6 MOQ &amp; OEM available upon request<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1940\" data-end=\"2074\">","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","curren