k. Ideal for serving dry food, displaying fruits, or as a decorative piece for hotels, restaurants, and eco-friendly stores.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"1097\">Vietnam Handicraft Co., Ltd is a trusted <strong data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1017\">manufacturer, factory, and wholesale supplier<\/strong> of sustainable homeware, offering customizable sizes and finishes upon request.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1102\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1128\">\u2705 <strong data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1126\">Key Features:<\/strong><\/h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1474\">\n<li data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1186\">\n<p data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1186\">Made of 100% natural spun bamboo and handwoven rattan<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1230\">\n<p data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1230\">Lightweight, durable, and biodegradable<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1289\">\n<p data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1289\">Eco-friendly, non-toxic finish (safe for food contact)<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1351\">\n<p data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1351\">Handmade by artisans in Vietnam using traditional methods<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1416\">\n<p data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1416\">Available in various sizes and finishes for wholesale orders<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1474\">\n<p data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1474\">Custom branding, labeling, and packaging upon request<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1479\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1481\" data-end=\"1508\">\ud83c\udf3f <strong data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1506\">Why It Matters:<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1509\" data-end=\"1644\">Our products are <strong data-start=\"1526\" data-end=\"1550\">100% made in Vietnam<\/strong> using domestic raw materials and local labor. By supporting handcrafted bamboo products, you:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1880\">\n<li data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1703\">\n<p data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1703\">Help generate <strong data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1689\">foreign exchange income<\/strong> for Vietnam<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1763\">\n<p data-start=\"1706\" data-end=\"1763\"><strong data-start=\"1706\" data-end=\"1727\">Create rural jobs<\/strong> during off-season farming periods<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1824\">\n<p data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1824\"><strong data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1796\">Preserve cultural heritage<\/strong> through sustainable craft<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1825\" data-end=\"1880\">\n<p data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1880\">Promote a <strong data-start=\"1837\" data-end=\"1878\">plastic-free, eco-conscious lifestyle<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1882\" data-end=\"1885\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1887\" data-end=\"1921\">\u2709\ufe0f <strong data-start=\"1893\" data-end=\"1919\">Contact for Wholesale:<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"2053\">\ud83d\udce7 Email: <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1932\" data-end=\"1955\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com<\/a><br data-start=\"1955\" data-end=\"1958\" \/>\ud83c\udf10 Web: <a class=\"\" href=\"http:\/\/www.vietcraft.vn\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1966\" data-end=\"2009\">www.vietcraft.vn<\/a><br data-start=\"2009\" data-end=\"2012\" \/>\ud83d\udce6 MOQ and pricing available upon inquiry.<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" \u20ab"},"price_html":"","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":794,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/VH24097-spun-bamboo-with-rattan-bowl.jpg?fit=510%2C600&ssl=1","thumbna