1\/products?related=790&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":787,"name":"Tissue Box from Rattan \u2013 Handwoven Natural Dispenser Cover from Vietnam","slug":"tissue-box-from-rattan-handwoven-natural-dispenser-cover-from-vietnam","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product\/tissue-box-from-rattan-handwoven-natural-dispenser-cover-from-vietnam\/","sku":"VH24087","short_description":"<p>Handwoven rattan tissue box cover \u2013 eco-friendly and stylish accessory made in Vietnam. Perfect for hotels, spas, or home use. Wholesale available.<\/p>","description":"<p data-start=\"306\" data-end=\"571\">This elegant <strong data-start=\"319\" data-end=\"345\">tissue box from rattan<\/strong> is a handwoven cover crafted by skilled artisans in Vietnam using 100% natural rattan. Designed to fit standard tissue boxes, it brings a touch of warmth and texture to living rooms, bathrooms, hotel rooms, spas, and offices.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"573\" data-end=\"778\">The fine weave, sturdy frame, and earthy tone make this product both functional and decorative. Its hinged or open-top design allows for easy tissue refill while maintaining a clean and stylish appearance.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"955\"><strong data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"811\">Vietnam Handicraft Co., Ltd<\/strong> is a trusted <strong data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"875\">manufacturer, supplier, and wholesale exporter<\/strong>, offering customization (OEM\/ODM) and bulk production for international buyers.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"960\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"984\">\u2705 <strong data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"984\">Key Features:<\/strong><\/h2>\n<ul data-start=\"985\" data-end=\"1342\">\n<li data-start=\"985\" data-end=\"1029\">\n<p data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"1029\">Made from eco-friendly, handwoven rattan<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1030\" data-end=\"1078\">\n<p data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1078\">Lightweight, durable, and moisture-resistant<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1126\">\n<p data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1126\">Fits most standard rectangular tissue boxes<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1180\">\n<p data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1180\">Available in natural, dark, or lacquered finishes<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1236\">\n<p data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1236\">Custom sizes, colors, logos, or packaging available<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1292\">\n<p data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1292\">Ideal for hotels, restaurants, spas, and home d\u00e9cor<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1342\">\n<p data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1342\">Biodegradable and ethically produced in Vietnam<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1347\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1376\">\ud83c\udf3f <strong data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1374\">Why It Matters:<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1426\">By choosing this handcrafted rattan product, you:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1754\">\n<li data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1481\">\n<p data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1481\"><strong data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1468\">Support local artisans and farmers<\/strong> in Vietnam<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1531\">\n<p data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1531\"><strong data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1529\">Utilize 100% domestic materials and labor<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1590\">\n<p data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1590\"><strong data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1572\">Contribute to export-driven income<\/strong> for the country<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1637\">\n<p data-start=\"1593\" data-end=\"1637\"><strong data-start=\"1593\" data-end=\"1635\">Create jobs during off-farming seasons<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1691\">\n<p data-start=\"1640\" data-end=\"1691\"><strong data-start=\"1640\" data-end=\"1689\">Preserve Vietnamese craftsmanship and culture<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1692\" data-end=\"1754\">\n<p data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1754\">Promote <strong data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"1754\">plastic-free, sustainable lifestyle alternatives<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1756\" data-end=\"1881\">As a certified <strong data-start=\"1771\" data-end=\"1805\">factory and wholesale exporter<\/strong>, Vietnam Handicraft ensures quality, value, and tradition in every product.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1886\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"1922\">\u2709\ufe0f <strong data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"1920\">Contact for Wholesale:<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1923\" data-end=\"2014\">\ud83d\udce7 Email: <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1933\" data-end=\"1956\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com<\/a><br data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"1959\" \/>\ud83c\udf10 Website: <a class=\"\" href=\"http:\/\/www.vietcraft.vn\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"2014\">www.vietcraft.vn<\/a><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2060\" data-end=\"2207\">","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" \u20ab"},"price_html":"","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":798,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/VH24087-tissue-box-made-of-rattan-wood.jpg?fit=510%2C600&ssl=1","thumbnail":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/VH24087-tissue-box-made-of-rattan-wood.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1","srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/VH24087-tissue-box-made-of-rattan-wood.jpg?w=510&ssl=1 510w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/V