 &ldquo;Rectangle Seagrass Basket \u2013 Handwoven Storage from Vietnam&rdquo;","url":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product\/rectangle-seagrass-basket-handwoven-storage-from-vietnam\/","single_text":"Add to cart","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/770","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=770&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":765,"name":"Pet House Made of Water-Hyacinth \u2013 Eco-Friendly Handwoven Shelter from Vietnam","slug":"pet-house-made-of-water-hyacinth-eco-friendly-handwoven-shelter-from-vietnam","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product\/pet-house-made-of-water-hyacinth-eco-friendly-handwoven-shelter-from-vietnam\/","sku":"VH24103","short_description":"<p>Handwoven pet house made of water-hyacinth \u2013 eco-friendly, durable, and stylish shelter for small pets. Made in Vietnam for global wholesale.<\/p>","description":"<p data-start=\"340\" data-end=\"585\">This charming <strong data-start=\"354\" data-end=\"390\">pet house made of water-hyacinth<\/strong> is a natural, breathable, and cozy space for your furry companions. Handwoven by skilled Vietnamese artisans, it combines functionality, comfort, and sustainable design in one beautiful product.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"891\">Ideal for small pets like cats and small dogs, the house features a rounded, enclosed shape that provides privacy and warmth. The sturdy natural fiber ensures durability, while the smooth texture is gentle on your pet&#8217;s skin. It\u2019s a stylish addition to homes, pet shops, hotels, and eco-conscious brands.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"1038\">At <strong data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"927\">Vietnam Handicraft Co., Ltd<\/strong>, we offer <strong data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"963\">OEM\/ODM customization<\/strong>, eco-friendly packaging, and <strong data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1018\">bulk wholesale supply<\/strong> to global partners.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1043\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1067\">\u2705 <strong data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1067\">Key Features:<\/strong><\/h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1402\">\n<li data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1109\">\n<p data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1109\">Made from 100% natural water-hyacinth<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1153\">\n<p data-start=\"1112\" data-end=\"1153\">Breathable, biodegradable, and pet-safe<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1206\">\n<p data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1206\">Handwoven with strong frame and smooth finishing<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1239\">\n<p data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1239\">Lightweight and easy to move<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1296\">\n<p data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1296\">Custom sizes, shapes, colors, and branding available<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1353\">\n<p data-start=\"1299\" data-end=\"1353\">Ideal for indoor pet use \u2013 cats, small dogs, rabbits<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1402\">\n<p data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1402\">Sustainable and ethically crafted in Vietnam<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1407\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1436\">\ud83c\udf3f <strong data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1434\">Why It Matters:<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1437\" data-end=\"1476\">Choosing this handmade pet house helps:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1772\">\n<li data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1531\">\n<p data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1531\"><strong data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1529\">Support rural artisans and farmers in Vietnam<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1599\">\n<p data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1599\"><strong data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1567\">Utilize excess water-hyacinth<\/strong>, reducing environmental waste<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1600\" data-end=\"1656\">\n<p data-start=\"1602\" data-end=\"1656\"><strong data-start=\"1602\" data-end=\"1638\">Generate foreign currency income<\/strong> through exports<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1725\">\n<p data-start=\"1659\" data-end=\"1725\"><strong data-start=\"1659\" data-end=\"1701\">Create jobs during non-harvest seasons<\/strong> for local communities<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1772\">\n<p data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1772\"><strong data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1772\">Preserve Vietnamese handcraft traditions<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1774\" data-end=\"1914\">As a reliable <strong data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1837\">manufacturer, factory, and wholesale exporter<\/strong>, <strong data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1870\">Vietnam Handicraft Co., Ltd<\/strong> is committed to quality and sustainability.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1916\" data-end=\"1919\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1921\" data-end=\"1955\">\u2709\ufe0f <strong data-start=\"1927\" data-end=\"1953\">Contact for Wholesale:<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"2047\">\ud83d\udce7 Email: <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1966\" data-end=\"1989\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com<\/a><br data-start=\"1989\" data-end=\"1992\" \/>\ud83c\udf10 Website: <a class=\"\" href=\"http:\/\/www.vietcraft.vn\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"2004\" data-end=\"2047\">www.vietcraft.vn<\/a><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2093\" data-end=\"2234\">","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suf