<strong data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"463\">spun bamboo craftsmanship<\/strong> and the refined elegance of <strong data-start=\"492\" data-end=\"523\">mother-of-pearl (MOP) inlay<\/strong>. Carefully handcrafted by skilled artisans, the vase features a smooth bamboo base shaped using spinning techniques, then adorned with hand-applied MOP shells to create shimmering, intricate patterns.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"932\">Perfect as a home accent, tabletop centerpiece, or hospitality d\u00e9cor, this vase is lightweight yet durable, blending natural beauty with luxury. It\u2019s suitable for dried flowers or as a standalone art piece.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"1121\">As a direct <strong data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"985\">manufacturer and wholesale exporter<\/strong> in Vietnam, <strong data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1029\">Vietnam Handicraft Co., Ltd<\/strong> offers <strong data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1062\">OEM\/ODM customization<\/strong>, eco-friendly packaging, and bulk supply to global buyers.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1126\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1128\" data-end=\"1150\">\u2705 <strong data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1150\">Key Features:<\/strong><\/h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1470\">\n<li data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1205\">\n<p data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1205\">Handmade from spun bamboo \u2013 lightweight and strong<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1263\">\n<p data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1263\">Exterior decorated with natural mother-of-pearl inlay<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1264\" data-end=\"1304\">\n<p data-start=\"1266\" data-end=\"1304\">Elegant, modern, and cultural appeal<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1363\">\n<p data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1363\">Suitable for home, hotel, restaurant, or gallery d\u00e9cor<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1419\">\n<p data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1419\">Available in multiple sizes, patterns, and finishes<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1470\">\n<p data-start=\"1422\" data-end=\"1470\">Sustainable, biodegradable, and ethically made<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1475\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1504\">\ud83c\udf3f <strong data-start=\"1483\" data-end=\"1502\">Why It Matters:<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1552\">By choosing this handcrafted vase, you support:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1554\" data-end=\"1857\">\n<li data-start=\"1554\" data-end=\"1603\">\n<p data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1603\"><strong data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1601\">Vietnamese artisans and rural communities<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1604\" data-end=\"1678\">\n<p data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1678\"><strong data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1631\">Cultural preservation<\/strong> of traditional spinning and inlay techniques<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1679\" data-end=\"1739\">\n<p data-start=\"1681\" data-end=\"1739\"><strong data-start=\"1681\" data-end=\"1707\">Sustainable production<\/strong> using 100% domestic materials<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1740\" data-end=\"1799\">\n<p data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1799\"><strong data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1769\">Export value generation<\/strong> for Vietnam\u2019s craft economy<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"1857\">\n<p data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"1857\"><strong data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"1857\">Plastic-free and eco-conscious home d\u00e9cor solutions<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1859\" data-end=\"2010\">At <strong data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1893\">Vietnam Handicraft Co., Ltd<\/strong>, we take pride in being your trusted <strong data-start=\"1931\" data-end=\"1977\">factory, manufacturer, and global supplier<\/strong> of handcrafted home accessories.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"2012\" data-end=\"2015\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"2017\" data-end=\"2051\">\u2709\ufe0f <strong data-start=\"2023\" data-end=\"2049\