uffet-style serving.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"895\">Each piece is made from layers of bamboo spun and shaped by hand, then polished and finished with food-safe coatings. The inner surface can be painted or left in natural tone, while the outer surface is customizable in various colors and patterns.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"1106\">As a leading <strong data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"951\">bamboo bowl manufacturer and exporter<\/strong> in Vietnam, we offer <strong data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"992\">OEM\/ODM options<\/strong>, custom packaging, and wholesale prices for global distributors, brands, hotels, restaurants, and gift companies.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_745\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-745\" style=\"width: 612px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-745\" src=\"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/Vietnam-spun-bamboo-bowls-612x400.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"612\" height=\"400\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-745\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Spun bamboo bowl manufacturer in Vietnam<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<hr data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1111\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1135\">\u2705 <strong data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1135\">Key Features:<\/strong><\/h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"1447\">\n<li data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"1191\">\n<p data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1191\">Set includes: 1 spun bamboo bowl + 1 spoon + 1 fork<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1229\">\n<p data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1229\">Handmade from 100% natural bamboo<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1273\">\n<p data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1273\">Lightweight, durable, and biodegradable<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1274\" data-end=\"1329\">\n<p data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1329\">Food-safe finishes (water-based or PU as requested)<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1383\">\n<p data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1383\">Customizable size, color, branding, and packaging<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1447\">\n<p data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1447\">Ideal for homes, hotels, restaurants, eco-stores, and gifts<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1452\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1454\" data-end=\"1481\">\ud83c\udf3f <strong data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1479\">Why It Matters:<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1579\">This spun bamboo salad set represents more than function \u2013 it delivers cultural and social value:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1813\">\n<li data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1634\">\n<p data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1634\"><strong data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1605\">Creates rural jobs<\/strong> during non-harvest seasons<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1683\">\n<p data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1683\"><strong data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1681\">Uses 100% Vietnamese materials and labor<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1684\" data-end=\"1744\">\n<p data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1744\"><strong data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1710\">Brings export income<\/strong> to support the national economy<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1745\" data-end=\"1813\">\n<p data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"1813\"><strong data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"1785\">Preserves traditional bamboo craft<\/strong> in a modern global market<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1967\">At <strong data-start=\"1818\" data-end=\"1849\">Vietnam Handicraft Co., Ltd<\/strong>, we are proud to be your trusted <strong data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1932\">factory, manufacturer, and wholesale supplier<\/strong> for high-quality bamboo tableware.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1969\" data-end=\"1972\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"2008\">\u2709\ufe0f <strong data-start=\"1980\" data-end=\"2006\">Contact for Wholesale:<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2009\" data-end=\"2100\">\ud83d\udce7 Ema